(gen_random_uuid(), 'mama-awards-2026-chapter-2-bigbang-nayeon-20261121', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'MAMA Awards 2026 Chapter 2: BigBang and Nayeon Lead Osaka Night',
'MAMA अवार्ड्स २०२६ च्याप्टर २: बिगब्याङ र नायोनले ओसाका रातको नेतृत्व गर्दै',
'The 2026 MAMA Awards close on 21 November in Osaka, with BigBang, Nayeon, IVE and LE SSERAFIM on the Chapter 2 bill at Kyocera Dome.',
'२०२६ MAMA अवार्ड्स २१ नोभेम्बरमा ओसाकामा सकिँदैछ, बिगब्याङ, नायोन, IVE र LE SSERAFIM च्याप्टर २ मा प्रस्तुत हुँदैछन्।',
$$<p>The 2026 MAMA Awards reach their second and final night on Saturday 21 November at Kyocera Dome Osaka, where Chapter 2 puts the focus on performances. BigBang, Nayeon of TWICE, IVE, LE SSERAFIM, Hwasa and ZEROBASEONE are among the 12 acts on the bill, with Park Bo-gum hosting both nights.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Event</td><td>2026 MAMA Awards, Chapter 2, Saturday 21 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Venue</td><td>Kyocera Dome Osaka, Japan</td></tr><tr><td>Start</td><td>Red carpet 12:30pm, show 3pm KST and JST</td></tr><tr><td>Chapter 2 acts</td><td>BigBang, Nayeon, IVE, LE SSERAFIM, Hwasa, CORTIS, izna, KiiiKiii, KO1KEYZ, WOODZ, ZEROBASEONE, and TEAM</td></tr><tr><td>Host</td><td>Park Bo-gum, hosting both nights</td></tr><tr><td>Theme</td><td>A Music Interstellar, the 28th edition</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>MAMA Awards 2026 Chapter 2: what to expect</h2><p>Chapter 1 on 20 November focused on artists, with CL, ENHYPEN, BABYMONSTER, ILLIT and TREASURE among 16 acts. Chapter 2 is the performance night, and it carries the biggest names for casual viewers: BigBang perform the day after their surprise digital single, and Nayeon gives the first live performance of BABY ANGEL from her new solo single album NA-sty. The Korea JoongAng Daily describes the two-night event as the largest single-venue line-up in MAMA history, with 27 acts in total. See more in our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/popmusic'>Pop Music</a> section and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/bts-mma-2026-six-wins-aria-award-20261120'>BTS MMA 2026 six wins</a> report.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>For BigBang, the night caps a 20th anniversary year that already brought the single BiiiG in August and a new digital single on 20 November. For Nayeon, it is the live launch of her first solo release in about two years and five months. The main awards include Best Male Group, where BigBang, BTS, ATEEZ, Stray Kids and ENHYPEN are nominated, and Best Female Group, with aespa, BLACKPINK, IVE, LE SSERAFIM and NMIXX among the nominees.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not publish a running order or setlists for Chapter 2, and they do not say which awards will be handed out on the second night rather than the first. No winners have been announced yet, so this article predicts the night to watch, not the results.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_MAMA_Awards'>Wikipedia, 2026 MAMA Awards</a> for dates, venue and line-ups; <a href='https://www.koreajoongangdaily.com/entertainment/mama-awards-goes-interstellar-with-big-bang-cl-leading-lineup/12980700'>Korea JoongAng Daily</a> for the line-up and theme; <a href='https://www.financialexpress.com/life/entertainment-where-to-watch-mama-awards-2026-check-live-streaming-details-full-lineup-nominees-more-4388571/'>Financial Express</a> for start times and nominees.</p>$$,
$$<p>२०२६ MAMA अवार्ड्स शनिबार २१ नोभेम्बरमा क्योसेरा डोम ओसाकामा दोस्रो र अन्तिम रातमा पुग्दैछ, जहाँ च्याप्टर २ मा प्रस्तुति केन्द्रित छ। बिगब्याङ, TWICE की नायोन, IVE, LE SSERAFIM, ह्वासा र ZEROBASEONE १२ प्रस्तोतामध्ये छन्, पार्क बो-गमले दुवै रात सञ्चालन गर्दैछन्।</p><p>पहिलो रात कलाकार केन्द्रित थियो भने दोस्रो रात प्रस्तुति रात हो। बिगब्याङले नयाँ डिजिटल सिंगलपछि प्रस्तुति दिनेछन् र नायोनले BABY ANGEL को पहिलो प्रत्यक्ष प्रस्तुति दिनेछिन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरूले प्रस्तुति क्रम वा सेटलिस्ट प्रकाशित गरेका छैनन्, र विजेताहरू अझै घोषणा भएका छैनन्।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_MAMA_Awards', 'https://www.koreajoongangdaily.com/entertainment/mama-awards-goes-interstellar-with-big-bang-cl-leading-lineup/12980700', 'https://www.financialexpress.com/life/entertainment-where-to-watch-mama-awards-2026-check-live-streaming-details-full-lineup-nominees-more-4388571/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- take-that-dreamers-album-10th-studio-20261121 (pop-music; English 336 words; Nepali 68 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'take-that-dreamers-album-10th-studio-20261121', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'Take That Dreamers Album Out Now as 10th Studio Record',
'टेक द्याट ड्रीमर्स एल्बम सार्वजनिक, दशौं स्टुडियो रेकर्ड',
'Take That released Dreamers, their 10th studio album, on 20 November 2026, with 12 tracks from Gary Barlow, Mark Owen and Howard Donald.',
'टेक द्याटले २० नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा ड्रीमर्स, आफ्नो दशौं स्टुडियो एल्बम सार्वजनिक गर्‍यो, ग्यारी बार्लो, मार्क ओवेन र हावर्ड डोनाल्डका १२ ट्र्याकसहित।',
$$<p>Take That released Dreamers, their 10th studio album, on 20 November 2026 through EMI. The 12-track record is the trio of Gary Barlow, Mark Owen and Howard Donald, and it follows the 2023 album This Life and the band Netflix documentary earlier in 2026.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Album</td><td>Dreamers, 10th studio album, 12 tracks, 42 minutes 31 seconds</td></tr><tr><td>Release date</td><td>20 November 2026, EMI</td></tr><tr><td>Line-up</td><td>Gary Barlow, Mark Owen, Howard Donald</td></tr><tr><td>Singles</td><td>You Are A Superstar, Sweet July, Feel My Love with Michael Patrick Kelly, Dreamers</td></tr><tr><td>Tour</td><td>Dreamers Tour opens in Zurich on 3 June 2027</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Take That Dreamers album: what happened</h2><p>The album was announced on 1 October 2026, when the band shared the title track and the artwork. It was recorded in London, New York, Nashville and Los Angeles, and the band chose the title in a dressing room during the summer revival of The Circus Live tour, which was seen by more than 700,000 people in 2026. A one-night show at the London Palladium on 13 November gave fans the first live performances of tracks from the album. See more in our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/popmusic'>Pop Music</a> section and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/coachella-2027-lineup-dua-lipa-sza-tame-impala-20261118'>Coachella 2027 line-up</a> report.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>Early reviews split on the record. The Times gave it three stars and called it reassuringly conventional age-appropriate pop, while Maxazine gave it 9 out of 10 and called it one of the best Take That albums in years. The Official Charts album list for 20 November puts Dreamers among the new releases of the week, and a strong first week would put the band in line for a 12th chart-topping album, equalling Bruce Springsteen.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give first-week sales or a chart position yet, because the chart for the release week had not been published when this article was written. They also do not confirm a full Dreamers Tour date list beyond the Zurich opening on 3 June 2027.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.officialcharts.com/chart-news/new-album-releases-2026/'>Official Charts</a> for the 20 November release date; <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dreamers_(Take_That_album)'>Wikipedia, Dreamers (Take That album)</a> for track count, length and tour dates; <a href='https://www.thetimes.com/culture/music/article/take-that-dreamers-review-new-albums-6bzsn2z55'>The Times</a> for the review.</p>$$,
$$<p>टेक द्याटले २० नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा EMI मार्फत ड्रीमर्स, आफ्नो दशौं स्टुडियो एल्बम सार्वजनिक गर्‍यो। १२ ट्र्याकको रेकर्ड ग्यारी बार्लो, मार्क ओवेन र हावर्ड डोनाल्डको त्रयी हो, र यो २०२३ को This Life पछिको एल्बम हो।</p><p>एल्बम १ अक्टोबर २०२६ मा घोषणा भएको थियो। लन्डन, न्यूयोर्क, नासभिल र लस एन्जलसमा रेकर्ड गरिएको थियो। ड्रीमर्स टुर ३ जुन २०२७ मा जुरिचमा खुल्दैछ।</p><p>स्रोतहरूले पहिलो हप्ताको बिक्री वा चार्ट स्थान दिएका छैनन्।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.officialcharts.com/chart-news/new-album-releases-2026/', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dreamers_(Take_That_album)', 'https://www.thetimes.com/culture/music/article/take-that-dreamers-review-new-albums-6bzsn2z55'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- bigbang-surprise-digital-single-november-20-20261121 (pop-music; English 301 words; Nepali 49 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'bigbang-surprise-digital-single-november-20-20261121', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'BigBang Surprise Digital Single Drops on 20 November',
'बिगब्याङ सरप्राइज डिजिटल सिंगल २० नोभेम्बरमा सार्वजनिक',
'BigBang released a surprise digital single at 2pm KST on 20 November 2026, three months after BiiiG, without revealing its title in advance.',
'बिगब्याङले २० नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा दिउँसो २ बजे KST मा सरप्राइज डिजिटल सिंगल सार्वजनिक गर्‍यो, BiiiG को तीन महिनापछि, शीर्षक अग्रिम नखुलाइकन।',
$$<p>BigBang released a surprise digital single at 2pm KST on 20 November 2026, three months after BiiiG, their first full-group song in about four years and four months. YG Entertainment announced the release the same morning with three black-and-white teaser posters and no title, only the words BIGBANG 2026.11.20. 2PM (KST).</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Release</td><td>Digital single, 20 November 2026, 2pm KST</td></tr><tr><td>Previous single</td><td>BiiiG, 19 August 2026, first full-group song since Still Life in April 2022</td></tr><tr><td>Members</td><td>G-Dragon, Taeyang, Daesung, as a three-member group</td></tr><tr><td>Occasion</td><td>20th anniversary of debut in 2006</td></tr><tr><td>Next</td><td>MAMA Awards Chapter 2 performance on 21 November in Osaka</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>BigBang surprise digital single: what happened</h2><p>The teaser posters showed close-up details only: a hand with flashy accessories, a booted foot stepping forward, and tousled hair, with no faces shown. Yonhap reported that YG shared the posters on its official blog without disclosing details of the song. The Korea Herald added that both the new song and BiiiG are slated to be included in an album BigBang plan to release next year. See more in our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/popmusic'>Pop Music</a> section and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/bts-mma-2026-six-wins-aria-award-20261120'>BTS MMA 2026 six wins</a> report.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The timing links the single directly to the MAMA Awards, where BigBang perform on 21 November, the day after the release. Their 20th anniversary world tour, XX: Cosmos, runs across 41 shows in 20 cities, with four cities in Japan from 27 November.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources available before release did not name the song title, its writers or producers, or its chart position. This article is thin on those facts because YG announced the single without them, and the title should be checked against the streaming release before the article is quoted.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://en.yna.co.kr/view/AEN20261120002100315?section=culture/k-pop'>Yonhap News Agency</a> for the release time and teaser; <a href='https://www.koreaherald.com/article/10943835'>Korea Herald</a> for the album plan and Japan tour dates; <a href='https://www.sportschosun.com/en/celebrity/2026-11-20/202611200100128330011991'>Sports Chosun</a> for the BiiiG timeline.</p>$$,
$$<p>बिगब्याङले २० नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा दिउँसो २ बजे KST मा सरप्राइज डिजिटल सिंगल सार्वजनिक गर्‍यो, BiiiG को तीन महिनापछि। YG इन्टरटेनमेन्टले सोही बिहान तीनवटा श्वेत-श्याम टिजर पोस्टरसहित घोषणा गर्‍यो, शीर्षक नखुलाइकन।</p><p>यो सिंगल MAMA अवार्ड्ससँग जोडिएको छ, जहाँ बिगब्याङले २१ नोभेम्बरमा प्रस्तुति दिनेछन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरूले गीतको शीर्षक, लेखक वा निर्माता दिएका छैनन्।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://en.yna.co.kr/view/AEN20261120002100315?section=culture/k-pop', 'https://www.koreaherald.com/article/10943835', 'https://www.sportschosun.com/en/celebrity/2026-11-20/202611200100128330011991'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- nayeon-na-sty-baby-angel-solo-comeback-20261121 (pop-music; English 280 words; Nepali 60 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'nayeon-na-sty-baby-angel-solo-comeback-20261121', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'Nayeon NA-sty Solo Comeback With Baby Angel on 20 November',
'नायोन NA-sty एकल पुनरागमन, बेबी एन्जलसहित २० नोभेम्बरमा',
'TWICE member Nayeon returned solo on 20 November 2026 with single album NA-sty, led by Baby Angel, ahead of her MAMA Awards debut on 21 November.',
'TWICE सदस्य नायोन २० नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा एकल एल्बम NA-sty सहित एकल रूपमा फर्किइन्, बेबी एन्जल मुख्य गीतसहित, २१ नोभेम्बरको MAMA प्रस्तुतिअघि।',
$$<p>TWICE member Nayeon returned as a solo artist on 20 November 2026 with the single album NA-sty, released at 2pm KST through JYP Entertainment. It is her first solo release in about two years and five months, and the title track is Baby Angel, a contemporary R and B pop track with a midtempo groove.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Release</td><td>NA-sty single album, 20 November 2026, 2pm KST, JYP Entertainment</td></tr><tr><td>Tracks</td><td>BABY ANGEL, SHiVER, BOY, three tracks in total</td></tr><tr><td>Title track</td><td>BABY ANGEL, with wing and halo hand choreography</td></tr><tr><td>Gap</td><td>First solo release in about two years and five months</td></tr><tr><td>Next</td><td>First live BABY ANGEL stage at MAMA Awards, 21 November, Osaka</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Nayeon NA-sty solo comeback: what happened</h2><p>The title NA-sty combines Nayeon style and being like Nayeon with the playful English word nasty. Nayeon co-wrote and co-composed the second track, SHiVER, and she described the Baby Angel performance as a twist on the cute title, with powerful choreography and a rap section she called a new challenge. The single album comes ahead of her first solo full-length album. See more in our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/popmusic'>Pop Music</a> section and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/bts-mma-2026-six-wins-aria-award-20261120'>BTS MMA 2026 six wins</a> report.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>Nayeon was the first TWICE member to release a solo album, and NA-sty is her third solo project. The MAMA stage on 21 November gives the comeback its biggest live audience on the second day, alongside BigBang, IVE and LE SSERAFIM.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give streaming numbers or chart positions for NA-sty yet, and they do not give a release date for the full-length solo album that NA-sty previews.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.allkpop.com/article/2026/11/twices-nayeon-returns-solo-with-na-sty-teases-first-live-baby-angel-stage-at-mama?auth=login'>allkpop</a> for the release time and MAMA debut; <a href='https://k-popit.com/articles/2026112089552'>K-POPIT</a> for the track list and Q and A; <a href='https://news.sbs.co.kr/english/article.do?news_id=N1008852997'>SBS</a> for the two-and-a-half-year gap.</p>$$,
$$<p>TWICE सदस्य नायोन २० नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा JYP इन्टरटेनमेन्टमार्फत एकल एल्बम NA-sty सहित एकल कलाकारका रूपमा फर्किइन्। यो करिब दुई वर्ष पाँच महिनापछिको पहिलो एकल रिलिज हो, मुख्य गीत बेबी एन्जल हो।</p><p>NA-sty नामले नायोनको शैली र अङ्ग्रेजी शब्द nasty लाई जोड्छ। नायोनले दोस्रो ट्र्याक SHiVER को लेखन र संगीतमा भाग लिएकी छिन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरूले स्ट्रिमिङ संख्या वा पूर्ण एल्बमको मिति दिएका छैनन्।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.allkpop.com/article/2026/11/twices-nayeon-returns-solo-with-na-sty-teases-first-live-baby-angel-stage-at-mama?auth=login', 'https://k-popit.com/articles/2026112089552', 'https://news.sbs.co.kr/english/article.do?news_id=N1008852997'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- fall-out-boy-aces-twilight-of-the-punks-tour-20261121 (pop-music; English 309 words; Nepali 53 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'fall-out-boy-aces-twilight-of-the-punks-tour-20261121', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'Fall Out Boy ACES Single and Twilight of the Punks Tour',
'फल आउट ब्वाय ACES सिंगल र ट्वाइलाइट अफ द पंक्स टुर',
'Fall Out Boy returned on 9 November 2026 with ACES, their first new single in over three years, and a 36-date Twilight of the Punks tour for 2027.',
'फल आउट ब्वाय ९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा ACES सहित फर्कियो, तीन वर्षभन्दा बढीपछिको पहिलो नयाँ सिंगल, र २०२७ का लागि ३६ मितिको ट्वाइलाइट अफ द पंक्स टुरसहित।',
$$<p>Fall Out Boy returned on 9 November 2026 with ACES, their first new original single in more than three years, and announced the 36-date Twilight of the Punks world tour for 2027. The single is out through Atlantic Records, with a music video directed by Brendan Walter.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Single</td><td>ACES, released 9 November 2026, Atlantic Records</td></tr><tr><td>Gap</td><td>First new original single in more than three years, since So Much (For) Stardust in March 2023</td></tr><tr><td>Producer</td><td>Neal Avron produced and mixed the track</td></tr><tr><td>Tour</td><td>Twilight of the Punks, 36 dates, starts 17 May 2027 in Prague</td></tr><tr><td>Album</td><td>No album announced; Patrick Stump told Rolling Stone there is no album currently</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Fall Out Boy ACES: what happened</h2><p>The band teased the return before Halloween with a cryptic post welcoming fans to Twilight Town Mall, then confirmed the single and tour on 9 November. The tour is billed as their largest global run, opening at Prague O2 Arena on 17 May 2027 and including a 5 June stop at Tottenham Hotspur Stadium in London. The North American leg features The Offspring, Good Charlotte and The Story So Far, while the Europe and UK leg features A Day To Remember and Neck Deep. Tickets went on sale on 13 November. See more in our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/popmusic'>Pop Music</a> section and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/coachella-2027-lineup-dua-lipa-sza-tame-impala-20261118'>Coachella 2027 line-up</a> report.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>ACES is a stand-alone single, not the start of an album campaign. Stump and bassist Pete Wentz both told Rolling Stone there is no record coming for now, with Wentz floating the idea of a Fall Out Boy musical instead. The announcement also marked the band 25th anniversary year.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give a full 36-date list in one place, and they do not give ticket prices or first-week streaming figures for ACES.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.nme.com/news/music/fall-out-boy-return-with-intense-single-aces-and-announce-2027-uk-european-and-north-american-twilight-of-the-punks-tour-3975527'>NME</a> for the single, tour dates and ticket sale; <a href='https://www.spinmagazine.com/2026/11/fall-out-boy-single-tour/'>SPIN</a> for the 36-date tour; <a href='https://www.iheart.com/alternate/amp/2026-11-09-fall-out-boy-drop-new-single-aces-announce-2027-stadium-tour/'>iHeartRadio</a> for the support acts.</p>$$,
$$<p>फल आउट ब्वाय ९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा ACES सहित फर्कियो, तीन वर्षभन्दा बढीपछिको पहिलो नयाँ मौलिक सिंगल, र २०२७ का लागि ३६ मितिको ट्वाइलाइट अफ द पंक्स विश्व टुर घोषणा गर्‍यो।</p><p>टुर १७ मे २०२७ मा प्रागमा सुरु हुन्छ र लन्डनको टोटनह्याम हट्स्पर स्टेडियममा ५ जुनमा रोकिन्छ।</p><p>ACES एकल सिंगल हो, एल्बम घोषणा भएको छैन।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.nme.com/news/music/fall-out-boy-return-with-intense-single-aces-and-announce-2027-uk-european-and-north-american-twilight-of-the-punks-tour-3975527', 'https://www.spinmagazine.com/2026/11/fall-out-boy-single-tour/', 'https://www.iheart.com/alternate/amp/2026-11-09-fall-out-boy-drop-new-single-aces-announce-2027-stadium-tour/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- pink-sphere-residency-las-vegas-2027-dates-20261121 (pop-music; English 307 words; Nepali 51 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'pink-sphere-residency-las-vegas-2027-dates-20261121', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'P!NK Sphere Residency Las Vegas 2027 Dates Go on Sale',
'P!NK स्फियर रेसिडेन्सी लस भेगास २०२७ मितिहरू बिक्रीमा',
'P!NK announced her first ever Las Vegas residency at Sphere, opening 29 September 2027, with general sale on 20 November 2026 after extra dates were added.',
'P!NK ले स्फियरमा आफ्नो पहिलो लस भेगास रेसिडेन्सी घोषणा गरिन्, २९ सेप्टेम्बर २०२७ मा खुल्दै, थप मितिहरूसहित २० नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा सामान्य बिक्री।',
$$<p>P!NK announced her first ever Las Vegas residency at Sphere, opening on 29 September 2027, with general sale on 20 November 2026. She is the first solo female pop artist to headline the venue, and the run was extended after the first nine dates were announced on 9 November.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Residency</td><td>P!NK Live at Sphere, Las Vegas, first ever residency</td></tr><tr><td>Opening</td><td>29 September 2027</td></tr><tr><td>First dates</td><td>29 September, 1, 2, 6, 8, 9, 27, 29, 30 October 2027, nine shows</td></tr><tr><td>General sale</td><td>20 November 2026, 10am PT, at pinkspage.com</td></tr><tr><td>Promoter</td><td>Live Nation, with Vibee travel packages</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>P!NK Sphere residency: what happened</h2><p>Sphere Entertainment announced the nine-date run on 9 November 2026, with artist presale from 18 November and general sale on 20 November. P!NK wrote that she had been developing the idea for years and that for the first time she was giving a show a home. The residency uses Sphere wraparound LED display and immersive audio. See more in our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/popmusic'>Pop Music</a> section and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/coachella-2027-lineup-dua-lipa-sza-tame-impala-20261118'>Coachella 2027 line-up</a> report.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The first is a career milestone for the three-time Grammy winner, whose live shows are known for aerial routines. The sources disagree on the total: Sphere official release lists nine dates through 30 October 2027, while USA Today lists further November 2027 dates and January 2028 dates, and SeatGeek reports the run grew to 18 performances through 29 January 2028. That expansion, if confirmed by Sphere, would stretch the residency across four months.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not confirm a setlist or how her aerial routines will work inside Sphere, and the official Sphere release does not list the November and January dates that USA Today and SeatGeek report. Ticket prices are not stated in the announcement.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.sphereentertainmentco.com/pnk-announces-2027-residency-at-sphere-in-las-vegas/'>Sphere Entertainment Co.</a> for the nine dates and sale times; <a href='https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2026/11/09/pink-sphere-residency-las-vegas/92692340007/'>USA Today</a> for the extended dates; <a href='https://news.pollstar.com/2026/11/09/pnk-announces-sphere-residency-in-las-vegas/'>Pollstar</a> for the first solo female headline claim.</p>$$,
$$<p>P!NK ले स्फियरमा आफ्नो पहिलो लस भेगास रेसिडेन्सी घोषणा गरिन्, २९ सेप्टेम्बर २०२७ मा खुल्दै, २० नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा सामान्य बिक्रीसहित। उनी भेन्युमा हेडलाइन गर्ने पहिलो एकल महिला पप कलाकार हुन्।</p><p>पहिलो नौ मिति ९ नोभेम्बरमा घोषणा भए, त्यसपछि थप मितिहरू थपिए।</p><p>स्रोतहरू कुल मितिमा फरक छन्: आधिकारिक विज्ञप्तिमा नौ, अन्य रिपोर्टमा १८।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.sphereentertainmentco.com/pnk-announces-2027-residency-at-sphere-in-las-vegas/', 'https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2026/11/09/pink-sphere-residency-las-vegas/92692340007/', 'https://news.pollstar.com/2026/11/09/pnk-announces-sphere-residency-in-las-vegas/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- u2-carnaval-de-luz-dolly-parton-torn-20261121 (pop-music; English 286 words; Nepali 55 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'u2-carnaval-de-luz-dolly-parton-torn-20261121', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'U2 Carnaval de Luz Album With Dolly Parton Torn Finale',
'U2 कार्नाभल दे लुज एल्बम, डली पार्टन टर्न फिनालेसहित',
'U2 released Carnaval de Luz, their 16th studio album, on 13 November 2026, closing with Torn, a duet with Dolly Parton recorded in June.',
'U2 ले १३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा कार्नाभल दे लुज, आफ्नो १६औं स्टुडियो एल्बम सार्वजनिक गर्‍यो, जुनमा रेकर्ड गरिएको डली पार्टनसँगको युगल टर्नसहित समापन।',
$$<p>U2 released Carnaval de Luz, their 16th studio album and first collection of new material in nine years, on 13 November 2026 through Island Records. The 12-song album closes with Torn, a duet with Dolly Parton that was recorded in Nashville in June 2026.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Album</td><td>Carnaval de Luz, 16th studio album, 12 songs</td></tr><tr><td>Release date</td><td>13 November 2026, Island Records, produced by Jacknife Lee</td></tr><tr><td>Closing track</td><td>Torn, duet with Dolly Parton, pedal steel by Daniel Lanois</td></tr><tr><td>Guests</td><td>Rosalia on The Mirror Maker</td></tr><tr><td>Anniversary</td><td>Released in the band 50th anniversary year</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>U2 Carnaval de Luz album: what happened</h2><p>The album follows two EPs earlier in 2026, Days of Ash and Easter Lily, and it is the band first studio album of new material since 2017. AllMusic called it a celebratory injection of positive vibes, while AudioFuzz called it an imperfect but welcome late-career renewal. The opening track is Go (Carnaval de Luz), followed by La Reina and Street of Dreams. See more in our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/popmusic'>Pop Music</a> section and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/dolly-parton-cma-awards-2026-tribute-20261117'>Dolly Parton CMA Awards tribute</a> report.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>Torn carries unusual weight: Entertainment Tonight reported that Dolly Parton recorded the song in Nashville in June 2026, making it her final recorded vocal performance before her death in August. A country version titled Torn (Kent Wells Version) premiered on country radio on 12 November. No UK or US chart position for the album was confirmed in the sources used here.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give first-week sales or a UK or US chart position for Carnaval de Luz yet. They also do not confirm a tour for the album.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.allmusic.com/album/carnaval-de-luz-mw0004889876'>AllMusic</a> for the album review and nine-year gap; <a href='https://www.audiofuzz.com/2026/11/13/u2-carnaval-de-luz-review-hot-new-album-friday/'>AudioFuzz</a> for the track list and Torn details; <a href='https://www.etonline.com/new-music-friday-november-13-u2-dolly-parton-enrique-iglesias-offset-wiz-khalifa-fall-out-boy-and'>Entertainment Tonight</a> for the Dolly Parton recording date.</p>$$,
$$<p>U2 ले १३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा आइल्यान्ड रेकर्ड्समार्फत कार्नाभल दे लुज, आफ्नो १६औं स्टुडियो एल्बम र नौ वर्षपछिको नयाँ सामग्रीको पहिलो संग्रह सार्वजनिक गर्‍यो। १२ गीतको एल्बम डली पार्टनसँगको युगल टर्नसहित सकिन्छ।</p><p>टर्न डली पार्टनले जुन २०२६ मा नासभिलमा रेकर्ड गरेकी थिइन्, उनको अन्तिम रेकर्ड गरिएको स्वर प्रस्तुति।</p><p>स्रोतहरूले पहिलो हप्ताको बिक्री वा चार्ट स्थान दिएका छैनन्।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.allmusic.com/album/carnaval-de-luz-mw0004889876', 'https://www.audiofuzz.com/2026/11/13/u2-carnaval-de-luz-review-hot-new-album-friday/', 'https://www.etonline.com/new-music-friday-november-13-u2-dolly-parton-enrique-iglesias-offset-wiz-khalifa-fall-out-boy-and'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- olivia-rodrigo-take-me-home-4-christmas-debut-20261121 (pop-music; English 348 words; Nepali 58 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'olivia-rodrigo-take-me-home-4-christmas-debut-20261121', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'Olivia Rodrigo Take Me Home 4 Christmas Debuts at No 32',
'ओलिभिया रोड्रिगो टेक मी होम ४ क्रिसमस नम्बर ३२ मा डेब्यु',
'Olivia Rodrigo released her first Christmas song, Take Me Home 4 Christmas, on 5 November 2026, and it debuted at No 32 on the Billboard Hot 100.',
'ओलिभिया रोड्रिगोले ५ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा आफ्नो पहिलो क्रिसमस गीत टेक मी होम ४ क्रिसमस सार्वजनिक गरिन्, र यो बिलबोर्ड हट १०० मा नम्बर ३२ मा डेब्यु गर्‍यो।',
$$<p>Olivia Rodrigo released her first Christmas song, Take Me Home 4 Christmas, on 5 November 2026 through Interscope Records, and it debuted at No 32 on the Billboard Hot 100 dated 21 November. It is her 45th career Hot 100 entry and her 38th top 40 hit, according to Billboard Charts.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Song</td><td>Take Me Home (4 Christmas), first holiday single</td></tr><tr><td>Release</td><td>5 November 2026, Interscope, 7 inch vinyl and cassette from 6 November</td></tr><tr><td>Writers</td><td>Olivia Rodrigo, Dan Nigro, Amy Allen, Kyle Amstutz; produced by Nigro with M. Wise</td></tr><tr><td>Hot 100</td><td>No 32 debut, chart dated 21 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>UK Singles</td><td>No 8, new entry in the 13 November chart</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Olivia Rodrigo Take Me Home 4 Christmas: what happened</h2><p>The song is about wanting a committed relationship and wishing a partner would take her home for Christmas to meet his parents. The official video features Cynthia Nixon and Saturday Night Live Ben Marshall, and the vinyl version includes an unreleased B-side, Miss This Christmas. It arrived weeks after the Expectations remix with Chappell Roan, which reached the Hot 100 top five and became the highest-peaking all-female collaboration of 2026 so far. See more in our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/popmusic'>Pop Music</a> section and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/olivia-rodrigo-grammy-nominations-2027-seven-20261117'>Olivia Rodrigo Grammy nominations 2027</a> report.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>Rodrigo is the only new holiday song on the Hot 100 dated 21 November, among eight seasonal tracks. Her third album, You Seem Pretty Sad for a Girl So in Love, also spent a fifth week at No 1 on the Billboard 200, tying Sour for her longest command. She is on The Unraveled Tour, with more than one million tickets sold globally, according to Universal Music Canada.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources disagree on the release date by a day: Wikipedia and Universal Music Canada give 5 November for streaming and 6 November for vinyl, while some chart summaries give 6 November as the release date. They do not give first-week streaming figures for the song alone.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.universalmusic.ca/2026/11/06/olivia-rodrigo-releases-first-holiday-single-take-me-home-4-christmas/'>Universal Music Canada</a> for the release and video; <a href='https://www.trygana.app/journal/christmas-songs-on-the-hot-100-2026'>Billboard chart summary, 17 November</a> for the No 32 debut; <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Take_Me_Home_(4_Christmas)'>Wikipedia, Take Me Home (4 Christmas)</a> for the UK No 8 peak.</p>$$,
$$<p>ओलिभिया रोड्रिगोले ५ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा इन्टरस्कोप रेकर्ड्समार्फत आफ्नो पहिलो क्रिसमस गीत टेक मी होम ४ क्रिसमस सार्वजनिक गरिन्, र यो २१ नोभेम्बरको बिलबोर्ड हट १०० मा नम्बर ३२ मा डेब्यु गर्‍यो।</p><p>गीत गम्भीर सम्बन्धको चाहना र क्रिसमसमा घर लैजाने विषयमा छ। भिडियोमा सिन्थिया निक्सन र बेन मार्शल छन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू रिलिज मितिमा एक दिन फरक छन्: ५ वा ६ नोभेम्बर।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.universalmusic.ca/2026/11/06/olivia-rodrigo-releases-first-holiday-single-take-me-home-4-christmas/', 'https://www.trygana.app/journal/christmas-songs-on-the-hot-100-2026', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Take_Me_Home_(4_Christmas)'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- wham-last-christmas-mariah-carey-hot-100-20261121 (pop-music; English 367 words; Nepali 57 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'wham-last-christmas-mariah-carey-hot-100-20261121', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'Wham Last Christmas Leads Mariah Carey on Hot 100 at No 14',
'व्हाम लास्ट क्रिसमस हट १०० मा नम्बर १४, मारिया केरीभन्दा अघि',
'Wham Last Christmas rose to No 14 on the Billboard Hot 100 dated 21 November 2026, ahead of Mariah Carey All I Want for Christmas Is You at No 18.',
'व्हामको लास्ट क्रिसमस २१ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को बिलबोर्ड हट १०० मा नम्बर १४ मा उक्लियो, मारिया केरीको अल आइ वान्ट फर क्रिसमस इज यु नम्बर १८ भन्दा अघि।',
$$<p>Wham Last Christmas rose to No 14 on the Billboard Hot 100 dated 21 November 2026, ahead of Mariah Carey All I Want for Christmas Is You at No 18. Eight holiday songs are on the chart, with Wham highest, even though Christmas is still weeks away and the chart tracks listening from 6 to 12 November.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Chart</td><td>Billboard Hot 100 dated 21 November 2026, tracking 6 to 12 November, posted 17 November</td></tr><tr><td>Last Christmas</td><td>Wham, No 14, up from No 37</td></tr><tr><td>All I Want for Christmas Is You</td><td>Mariah Carey, No 18, up from No 39, 22 weeks at No 1 in total, 81 weeks on the chart</td></tr><tr><td>Holiday songs</td><td>Eight in total on the Hot 100</td></tr><tr><td>Other entries</td><td>Jingle Bell Rock No 28, Rockin Around the Christmas Tree No 30, Santa Tell Me No 43, Underneath the Tree No 45</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Wham Last Christmas Mariah Carey Hot 100: what happened</h2><p>Both songs were already on the chart a week earlier, at No 37 and No 39, and both jumped this week as holiday streaming rose. Last Christmas reached a career-best No 2 last December, behind Carey, whose 1994 single has spent 22 weeks at No 1. This week the gap between them doubled, from two places to four. Billboard holiday rules let seasonal songs return above No 50 however many weeks they have already spent on the chart. See more in our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/popmusic'>Pop Music</a> section and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/ella-langley-choosin-texas-28-weeks-hot-100-record-20261117'>Ella Langley Choosin Texas 28 weeks</a> report.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>Wham leading the holiday pack is notable because Carey song is the bigger historical hit, with 22 weeks at No 1 against a No 2 peak for Last Christmas. The early return, before Thanksgiving, shows holiday listening starting earlier each year, and both songs are likely to climb further into December as radio rotations increase.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give exact streaming figures for the 21 November chart week for either song. The 7.1 million streams, up 295 percent, quoted for Carey song refers to the previous week, dated 14 November, not this week.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://hallaback.com/ella-langley-wham-mariah-carey-more-highlights-of-this-week-s-billboard-charts-639673.html'>Billboard chart highlights, 17 November</a> for the No 14 and No 18 positions; <a href='https://www.mensjournal.com/news/whams-christmas-classic-leads-the-hot-100s-8-holiday-hits-widens-gap-over-mariah-carey'>Mens Journal</a> for the gap widening; <a href='https://www.trygana.app/journal/christmas-songs-on-the-hot-100-2026'>Billboard chart summary</a> for the eight holiday songs and chart rules.</p>$$,
$$<p>व्हामको लास्ट क्रिसमस २१ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को बिलबोर्ड हट १०० मा नम्बर १४ मा उक्लियो, मारिया केरीको अल आइ वान्ट फर क्रिसमस इज यु नम्बर १८ भन्दा अघि। चार्टमा आठवटा छुट्टी गीतहरू छन्।</p><p>दुवै गीत अघिल्लो हप्ता पनि चार्टमा थिए। लास्ट क्रिसमस गत डिसेम्बरमा करियरकै उत्कृष्ट नम्बर २ मा पुगेको थियो।</p><p>स्रोतहरूले यस हप्ताको ठ्याक्कै स्ट्रिमिङ संख्या दिएका छैनन्।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://hallaback.com/ella-langley-wham-mariah-carey-more-highlights-of-this-week-s-billboard-charts-639673.html', 'https://www.mensjournal.com/news/whams-christmas-classic-leads-the-hot-100s-8-holiday-hits-widens-gap-over-mariah-carey', 'https://www.trygana.app/journal/christmas-songs-on-the-hot-100-2026'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- jamie-miller-babydoll-uk-singles-chart-20261121 (pop-music; English 388 words; Nepali 54 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'jamie-miller-babydoll-uk-singles-chart-20261121', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'Jamie Miller Babydoll Stays UK No 1 as Tate McRae Chases',
'जेमी मिलर बेबीडल UK नम्बर १ मा कायम, टेट म्याक्रे पछ्याउँदै',
'Jamie Miller Babydoll held No 1 on the Official Singles Chart, with Tate McRae Housewife at No 3, and midweek sales put Babydoll ahead again for 20 November.',
'जेमी मिलरको बेबीडल आधिकारिक सिंगल्स चार्टमा नम्बर १ मा कायम रह्यो, टेट म्याक्रे हाउसवाइफ नम्बर ३ मा, र मध्यहप्ताको बिक्रीले २० नोभेम्बरमा पनि बेबीडललाई अघि राख्यो।',
$$<p>Jamie Miller Babydoll held No 1 on the Official Singles Chart, with Tate McRae Housewife at No 3, and midweek sales put Babydoll ahead again for the chart due on 20 November. The confirmed chart for the week of 13 November had Babydoll at No 1 for a 12th week, with Ashe Stop The Wedding at No 2 and Housewife at No 3.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Chart</td><td>Official Singles Chart, week of 13 November 2026, confirmed</td></tr><tr><td>No 1</td><td>Babydoll, Jamie Miller, 12 weeks on chart, peak No 1</td></tr><tr><td>No 2</td><td>Stop The Wedding, Ashe, peak No 2, 13 weeks</td></tr><tr><td>No 3</td><td>Housewife, Tate McRae, peak No 2, 4 weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Midweek 20 November</td><td>Babydoll 20,873 sales, Ashe 11,134, sombr 8,713, Housewife 8,653</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Jamie Miller Babydoll UK chart: what happened</h2><p>The top 10 for 13 November also included Sienna Spiro Great Expectation at No 4, sombr My Body Is Not Ready at No 5, Ella Langley Choosin Texas at No 6, Olivia Rodrigo and Chappell Roan Expectations at No 7, Olivia Rodrigo Take Me Home (4 Christmas) at No 8 as the only new entry in the top 40, Adela Nicole Kidman at No 9, and Sam Fender and Olivia Dean Rein Me In at No 10. Tate McRae Housewife was also No 1 on Apple Music in seven countries on 20 November, including Canada, Germany and Austria. See more in our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/popmusic'>Pop Music</a> section and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/billie-eilish-spotify-three-billion-streams-record-20261118'>Billie Eilish Spotify three billion streams</a> report.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The midweek update published on 19 November put Babydoll well ahead, with 20,873 sales against 11,134 for Ashe, so a fourth week at No 1 on the 20 November chart looks likely, though the final chart had not been published when this article was written. That is the prediction in this article, not a confirmed result. Housewife at No 3 in the UK and No 4 on the US Hot 100 dated 21 November shows Tate McRae holding across both markets at once.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give the final Official Singles Chart for 20 November yet, so the stay at No 1 is a midweek prediction, not a confirmed position. They also do not give a full top 100 for the new week.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.officialcharts.com/songs/mkkareen-lomax-mk/'>Official Charts</a> for the chart positions and weeks on chart; <a href='https://energyradio.uk/uk-charts-this-week-13-november-2026/'>Energy Radio</a> for the 13 November top 10; <a href='https://www.buzzjack.com/forums/topic/290446-friday-chart-predictions/?&do=findComment&comment=8075663'>BuzzJack Friday Chart Predictions</a> for the midweek sales figures.</p>$$,
$$<p>जेमी मिलरको बेबीडल आधिकारिक सिंगल्स चार्टमा नम्बर १ मा कायम रह्यो, टेट म्याक्रे हाउसवाइफ नम्बर ३ मा, र मध्यहप्ताको बिक्रीले २० नोभेम्बरको चार्टमा पनि बेबीडललाई अघि राख्यो।</p><p>१३ नोभेम्बरको चार्टमा बेबीडल १२औं हप्तामा नम्बर १ मा थियो। मध्यहप्तामा बेबीडल २०,८७३ बिक्रीसहित अघि थियो।</p><p>२० नोभेम्बरको अन्तिम चार्ट अझै प्रकाशित भएको छैन, त्यसैले यो मध्यहप्ताको पूर्वानुमान हो।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.officialcharts.com/songs/mkkareen-lomax-mk/', 'https://energyradio.uk/uk-charts-this-week-13-november-2026/', 'https://www.buzzjack.com/forums/topic/290446-friday-chart-predictions/?&do=findComment&comment=8075663'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- xiaomi-18-pro-max-global-launch-20261121 (tech-ai; English 620 words; Nepali 81 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'xiaomi-18-pro-max-global-launch-20261121', 'tech-ai', 'Global',
'Xiaomi 18 Pro Max Goes Global With Rear Display',
'स्याओमी १८ प्रो म्याक्स रियर डिस्प्लेसहित विश्वभर सार्वजनिक',
'Xiaomi 18 Pro Max launched globally in Paris on 17 November, with a rear display, dual 200MP Leica cameras and prices from 1,599 euros.',
'स्याओमी १८ प्रो म्याक्स १७ नोभेम्बरमा पेरिसमा विश्वभर सार्वजनिक भयो, रियर डिस्प्ले र डुअल २०० एमपी क्यामेरासहित।',
$$<p>Xiaomi 18 Pro Max went on sale outside China for the first time on 17 November 2026, when Xiaomi launched the 18 Pro and 18 Pro Max at an event in Paris. The Pro Max starts at 1,599 euros, carries a second screen on its back, and pairs dual 200MP Leica cameras with the Snapdragon 8 Elite Extreme Gen 6 chip. There is no launch planned for the United States or Canada.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Detail</th><th>Xiaomi 18 Pro Max</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Global launch</td><td>17 November 2026, Paris</td></tr><tr><td>Starting price</td><td>1,599 euros (12GB RAM, 256GB storage); 1,799 euros for 512GB</td></tr><tr><td>Rear display</td><td>2.9-inch AMOLED, beside the cameras</td></tr><tr><td>Main display</td><td>6.9-inch LTPO OLED, up to 4,000 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Chip</td><td>Snapdragon 8 Elite Extreme Gen 6</td></tr><tr><td>Cameras</td><td>Dual 200MP Leica rear cameras plus 50MP ultra-wide</td></tr><tr><td>Global battery</td><td>7,050mAh</td></tr><tr><td>Singapore pre-orders</td><td>18 to 23 November 2026; S$2,099 for 256GB, S$2,299 for 512GB</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Xiaomi 18 Pro Max: what happened</h2><p>Xiaomi launched the 18 Pro and 18 Pro Max globally in Paris on 17 November, bringing the rear-screen design outside China for the first time. The previous 17 Pro series stayed in mainland China. The Pro Max has a 2.9-inch rear display built into the raised camera area, which works as a viewfinder for rear-camera selfies, shows notifications, maps and music, and can run small AI-generated apps. The smaller 18 Pro has a 2.7-inch rear display and starts at 1,399 euros. In Singapore, pre-orders run from 18 to 23 November, with the Pro Max at S$2,099 for 256GB and S$2,299 for 512GB, and a S$200 promotional discount during the pre-order window, taking the 256GB model to S$1,899. In the UK, the Pro starts at 1,199 pounds and the Pro Max at 1,399 pounds. For more on new phones, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/tech-ai'>Tech news</a> hub and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/google-pixel-drop-november-2026-pixel-tag-20261120'>Google Pixel Drop and Pixel Tag</a> article.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The rear display is the story here: no other major phone sold outside China has a second screen on its back, and Xiaomi is betting that a selfie viewfinder and glanceable notifications are worth a flagship price. The trade-off is the battery. Global models ship with smaller cells than the China versions: the Pro Max has a 7,050mAh battery globally against 8,500mAh in China, and the Pro has 6,000mAh globally. Xiaomi has not explained the smaller global batteries. The pricing also puts the Pro Max against the iPhone Pro Max and the Galaxy Ultra range in Europe and Singapore, while American buyers are left out entirely, since Xiaomi does not sell phones in the United States.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give an India launch date or price for either phone. Xiaomi has confirmed the 18 Pro is coming to India, but has not shared a date, and it is not confirmed whether the Pro Max will come to India at all. The sources do not give sale dates for Europe or the UK, and they do not say when the 16GB and 1TB Pro Max configuration, listed at 2,099 euros, will be available. Note on the battery: an early briefing note for this article gave 8,500mAh, but that is the China version of the Pro Max; the global version is 7,050mAh, as confirmed by multiple launch reports.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.91mobiles.com/hub/xiaomi-18-pro-pro-max-launched-globally-price-specifications/'>91mobiles</a> for the global launch, prices and specifications; <a href='https://www.hardwarezone.com.sg/mobile/smartphones/xiaomi-announce-singapore-availability-xiaomi-18-pro-max?ref=contentblockl'>HardwareZone</a> for Singapore prices and the pre-order window; <a href='https://www.talkandroid.com/535591-xiaomi-18-pro-max-global-launch/'>TalkAndroid</a> for the absence of a US launch; <a href='https://www.gizbot.com/mobile/news/xiaomi-18-pro-18-pro-max-launched-globally-with-dual-200mp-cameras-rear-displays-and-more-129787.html'>Gizbot</a> for the India position.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Will the Xiaomi 18 Pro Max launch in the United States?</h3><p>No. Xiaomi has no plans to sell either the 18 Pro or the Pro Max in the US, and no US pricing has been announced.</p><h3>Will the Xiaomi 18 Pro Max launch in India?</h3><p>That is not confirmed. Xiaomi has confirmed the 18 Pro is coming to India but has given no date, and has not said whether the Pro Max will follow.</p>$$,
$$<p>स्याओमी १८ प्रो म्याक्स १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा पेरिसमा विश्वभर सार्वजनिक भयो। यसको मूल्य १,५९९ युरोबाट सुरु हुन्छ। फोनको पछाडि २.९ इन्चको दोस्रो डिस्प्ले छ, डुअल २०० मेगापिक्सेल लेइका क्यामेरा र स्न्यापड्रागन ८ एलिट एक्सट्रिम जेन ६ चिप छ। सिंगापुरमा प्रि-अर्डर १८ देखि २३ नोभेम्बरसम्म खुला छ, मूल्य २,०९९ सिंगापुर डलरबाट सुरु हुन्छ। अमेरिका र क्यानडामा यो फोन आउने छैन। भारतमा कहिले आउँछ भन्ने अझै पुष्टि भएको छैन। विश्व संस्करणको ब्याट्री ७,०५० एमएएच छ, जुन चीन संस्करणको ८,५०० एमएएचभन्दा सानो हो।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.91mobiles.com/hub/xiaomi-18-pro-pro-max-launched-globally-price-specifications/', 'https://www.hardwarezone.com.sg/mobile/smartphones/xiaomi-announce-singapore-availability-xiaomi-18-pro-max?ref=contentblockl', 'https://www.talkandroid.com/535591-xiaomi-18-pro-max-global-launch/', 'https://www.gizbot.com/mobile/news/xiaomi-18-pro-18-pro-max-launched-globally-with-dual-200mp-cameras-rear-displays-and-more-129787.html'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- anthropic-ant-first-day-trading-results-20261121 (tech-ai; English 527 words; Nepali 58 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'anthropic-ant-first-day-trading-results-20261121', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'Anthropic ANT Shares Close 17 Percent Higher on Debut',
'एन्थ्रोपिक एएनटी सेयर पहिलो दिन १७ प्रतिशत माथि बन्द',
'Anthropic ANT closed its first Nasdaq trading day at 97.17 dollars, up 17 percent from the 83 dollar IPO price, after opening at 111.50 dollars.',
'एन्थ्रोपिक एएनटी पहिलो कारोबार दिन ९७.१७ डलरमा बन्द भयो, ८३ डलरको आईपीओ मूल्यभन्दा १७ प्रतिशत माथि।',
$$<p>Anthropic ANT closed its first day of trading on the Nasdaq at 97.17 dollars on 19 November 2026, up 17 percent from its 83 dollar IPO price. The Claude maker raised 81.3 billion dollars in the largest initial public offering on record, and the shares opened at 111.50 dollars before giving back much of the early gain.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Detail</th><th>First trading day, 19 November 2026</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>IPO price</td><td>83 dollars per share</td></tr><tr><td>Shares sold</td><td>980 million</td></tr><tr><td>Money raised</td><td>81.3 billion dollars</td></tr><tr><td>Opening trade</td><td>111.50 dollars, up 34 percent</td></tr><tr><td>Day high</td><td>115.10 dollars</td></tr><tr><td>Closing price</td><td>97.17 dollars, up 17 percent</td></tr><tr><td>Shares traded</td><td>About 846 million</td></tr><tr><td>Revenue, nine months to 30 September</td><td>33.24 billion dollars, up about 1,200 percent year on year</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Anthropic ANT: what happened</h2><p>Anthropic, the AI lab behind the Claude chatbot, began trading on the Nasdaq under the ticker ANT on Thursday 19 November, after pricing 980 million shares at 83 dollars each. The first trade printed at 111.50 dollars, more than 34 percent above the IPO price, and the stock climbed as high as 115.10 dollars before sliding through the afternoon to close at 97.17 dollars. About 846 million shares changed hands, more than the roughly 522 million traded on the opening day of the SpaceX listing in June. The offering raised 81.3 billion dollars, the most ever raised in an IPO, ahead of the previous record set by SpaceX. For more on the company, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/tech-ai'>Tech news</a> hub and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/anthropic-ipo-debut-ant-first-trade-20261119'>Anthropic IPO debut guide</a>, published before trading began.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The debut makes Anthropic the first major AI lab to become a publicly traded company, and it puts the firm among the ten most valuable listed companies in the United States. The shape of the day matters as much as the close: the stock opened above 2 trillion dollars in value, then fell back, which suggests strong demand at the open and profit-taking afterwards rather than a steady climb. The prospectus showed revenue of 33.24 billion dollars for the nine months to 30 September, up roughly 1,200 percent from the same period last year, but several reports note that profitability concerns remain. Anthropic also raised a further 26 billion dollars in private investment alongside the offering, from investors including Nvidia, Microsoft and Google, taking the total raised around the listing to 107.3 billion dollars.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources disagree on the market value at the close, and both figures are reported here. Based on shares outstanding, the value was about 1.28 trillion dollars, according to Barron's and the Herald Business report. On a fully diluted basis, including stock options and convertible bonds, the value was about 1.75 trillion dollars, according to Dealroom, Korea JoongAng Daily and Chosun Biz. Reuters put the fully diluted figure at about 1.8 trillion dollars. The sources do not say when Anthropic expects to become profitable, and they do not break out how much of the revenue comes from Claude subscriptions against business and API customers.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.reuters.com/legal/transactional/anthropics-15-trillion-debut-rewrites-venture-capitals-playbook-2026-11-19/'>Reuters</a> for the debut and the fully diluted valuation; <a href='https://www.investopedia.com/anthropic-ipo-live-blog-ant-stock-12264678'>Investopedia</a> for the opening, high and closing prices; <a href='https://www.barrons.com/articles/stocks-today-anthropic-pops-markets-drop-99d9edca'>Barron's</a> for the closing market value on shares outstanding; <a href='https://dealroom.co/news/174510-anthropic-s-81-3b-ipo-ends-day-at-1-75t-valuation/'>Dealroom</a> for the money raised and the fully diluted value; <a href='https://biz.chosun.com/en/en-it/2026/11/20/WUF7C3UHCZENHC5I6BM565RQZ4/'>Chosun Biz</a> for the trading volume and the private investment total.</p>$$,
$$<p>एन्थ्रोपिक एएनटी १९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा न्यास्ड्याकमा पहिलो कारोबार दिन ९७.१७ डलरमा बन्द भयो, आईपीओ मूल्य ८३ डलरभन्दा १७ प्रतिशत माथि। सेयर १११.५० डलरमा खुल्यो र ११५.१० डलरसम्म पुग्यो। कम्पनीले ८१.३ अर्ब डलर उठायो, जुन अहिलेसम्मकै सबैभन्दा ठूलो आईपीओ हो। सेयर संख्याका आधारमा बजार मूल्य करिब १.२८ ट्रिलियन डलर थियो, पूर्ण रूपमा पातलो आधारमा करिब १.७५ ट्रिलियन डलर।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.reuters.com/legal/transactional/anthropics-15-trillion-debut-rewrites-venture-capitals-playbook-2026-11-19/', 'https://www.investopedia.com/anthropic-ipo-live-blog-ant-stock-12264678', 'https://www.barrons.com/articles/stocks-today-anthropic-pops-markets-drop-99d9edca', 'https://dealroom.co/news/174510-anthropic-s-81-3b-ipo-ends-day-at-1-75t-valuation/', 'https://biz.chosun.com/en/en-it/2026/11/20/WUF7C3UHCZENHC5I6BM565RQZ4/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- google-gemini-4-neon-launch-20261121 (tech-ai; English 527 words; Nepali 67 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'google-gemini-4-neon-launch-20261121', 'tech-ai', 'Global',
'Google Gemini 4 Neon Launches for Fast Coding Work',
'गुगल जेमिनी ४ निअन छिटो कोडिङ कार्यका लागि सार्वजनिक',
'Google Gemini 4 Neon launched on 18 November, promising frontier-level coding and research at three times the speed of Carbon, at 3 dollars per million tokens.',
'गुगल जेमिनी ४ निअन १८ नोभेम्बरमा सार्वजनिक भयो, कार्बनभन्दा तीन गुणा छिटो कोडिङ र अनुसन्धानको वाचा गर्दै।',
$$<p>Google Gemini 4 Neon launched on 18 November 2026, sitting between the flagship Carbon model and the lighter Hydrogen model in the Gemini 4 family. Google says Neon matches Carbon on quality for complex coding, research and business work while finishing tasks three times faster, and it is priced at 3 dollars per million input tokens.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Detail</th><th>Gemini 4 Neon</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Launch date</td><td>18 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Position in the family</td><td>Between Carbon (flagship) and Hydrogen (fast, light)</td></tr><tr><td>Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index</td><td>61 at xhigh thinking level, third overall</td></tr><tr><td>Context window</td><td>1 million tokens</td></tr><tr><td>API price</td><td>3 dollars per million input tokens; 15 dollars per million output tokens</td></tr><tr><td>Cached input price</td><td>0.15 dollars per million tokens</td></tr><tr><td>Thinking levels</td><td>Four: Low, Medium, High and Extra High</td></tr><tr><td>Availability</td><td>Gemini API in AI Studio, Gemini for business, Gemini app for Pro and Ultra subscribers</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Gemini 4 Neon: what happened</h2><p>Google introduced Gemini 4 Neon on 18 November, less than a week after launching Hydrogen on 12 November. Neon is built for complex, high-frequency work: multi-step coding, data analysis, scientific research and business automation. Google reports that Neon scored 61 on the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index at its highest thinking level, placing it third overall, and that it ranked first on the Artificial Analysis Coding Agent Index with 58.6 and scored 65.2 percent on Terminal-Bench 4.1. The model takes text, image, audio and video input, and its 1 million-token context window can hold spreadsheets, PDFs, charts, audio and video in one session. A cybersecurity variant, Gemini 4 Neon for cyber, is being released to approved security defenders under the Fairwind Program. For more on the Gemini family, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/tech-ai'>Tech news</a> hub and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/google-gemini-4-hydrogen-review-benchmarks-20261119'>Gemini 4 Hydrogen review and benchmarks</a> article.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>Neon is Google's answer to a practical problem: the most capable models are slow and expensive, while the fast models are weaker. Google claims Neon completes tasks three times faster than Carbon at 60 percent of the cost per task, and that at the default high thinking level the cost per task is 32 percent lower than Carbon. The pricing needs care, because Carbon is on promotional pricing of 2 dollars per million input tokens until 30 November, after which it rises to 4 dollars, making Neon 25 percent cheaper than Carbon at full price. Neon also replaces Argon in the lineup, and the older 3.1 Pro model is being retired for paid users, according to 9to5Google. That is a fast churn of models: three Gemini 4 models in under a month, which gives developers more choice but also more to keep track of.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>All of the benchmark figures in this article are Google's own reported results, and the sources do not include an independent test of Neon. The sources do not say when Neon will reach free-tier Gemini users, since the launch covers paid Pro and Ultra subscribers, the API and business customers. The sources do not give a date for the wider release of the cyber variant beyond the coming days for approved defenders.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/introducing-gemini-4-neon/?utm_source=deepmind.google&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gdm&utm_content='>Google Blog</a>, the official announcement, for the launch, benchmarks and pricing; <a href='https://9to5google.com/2026/11/18/gemini-4-neon-announcement/'>9to5Google</a> for availability and the retirement of Argon and 3.1 Pro; <a href='https://www.neowin.net/news/google-launches-gemini-4-neon-claims-its-three-times-faster-than-carbon/'>Neowin</a> for the pricing comparison with Carbon; <a href='https://interestingengineering.com/ai-robotics/google-gemini-4-neon-faster-coding-research'>Interesting Engineering</a> for the benchmark detail.</p>$$,
$$<p>गुगल जेमिनी ४ निअन १८ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा सार्वजनिक भयो। यो कार्बन र हाइड्रोजनबीचको मोडेल हो। गुगलका अनुसार निअनले कार्बनसरहको गुणस्तर दिन्छ तर तीन गुणा छिटो काम गर्छ। यसको मूल्य प्रति दस लाख इनपुट टोकन ३ डलर छ। सन्दर्भ विन्डो १० लाख टोकन छ। यो एपीआई, एआई स्टुडियो र प्रो तथा अल्ट्रा ग्राहकका लागि उपलब्ध छ। सबै बेन्चमार्क तथ्यांक गुगलकै रिपोर्ट गरिएका हुन्, स्वतन्त्र परीक्षण अझै छैन।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/introducing-gemini-4-neon/?utm_source=deepmind.google&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gdm&utm_content=', 'https://9to5google.com/2026/11/18/gemini-4-neon-announcement/', 'https://www.neowin.net/news/google-launches-gemini-4-neon-claims-its-three-times-faster-than-carbon/', 'https://interestingengineering.com/ai-robotics/google-gemini-4-neon-faster-coding-research'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- microsoft-outlook-outage-cause-bug-since-july-20261121 (tech-ai; English 550 words; Nepali 63 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'microsoft-outlook-outage-cause-bug-since-july-20261121', 'tech-ai', 'Global',
'Microsoft Outlook Outage Caused by Bug Since July',
'माइक्रोसफ्ट आउटलुक अवरोध जुलाईदेखिको बगका कारण',
'Microsoft Outlook outage of 12 to 14 November was caused by a bug sitting undetected in its data centres since July, Microsoft told customers this week.',
'१२ देखि १४ नोभेम्बरको माइक्रोसफ्ट आउटलुक अवरोध जुलाईदेखि लुकेको बगका कारण भएको माइक्रोसफ्टले बताएको छ।',
$$<p>The Microsoft Outlook outage that hit businesses and governments worldwide from 12 to 14 November 2026 was caused by a software bug that had sat undetected in Microsoft's data centres since July, the company told customers in a preliminary report this week. A routine rerouting of traffic on 11 November triggered the fault, and at the worst point more than 80 percent of the servers behind Outlook were unresponsive.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Detail</th><th>Microsoft 365 outage, November 2026</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Outage dates</td><td>12 to 14 November 2026, about 36 hours</td></tr><tr><td>Services hit</td><td>Outlook, Teams, Copilot and other Microsoft 365 services, via Exchange Online</td></tr><tr><td>Root cause</td><td>Undetected defect in networking gateway servers, present since July 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Trigger</td><td>Routine traffic rerouting on 11 November, plus a 14 percent cut in gateway capacity</td></tr><tr><td>Peak impact</td><td>More than 80 percent of networking gateway servers unresponsive</td></tr><tr><td>Outage reports</td><td>More than 7.4 million on Downdetector, from over 70 countries</td></tr><tr><td>Estimated insured losses</td><td>300 to 500 million dollars, per Morningstar DBRS</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Microsoft Outlook outage: what happened</h2><p>The outage began on 12 November, when reports of Outlook and Teams failures climbed from about 17:25 GMT. Microsoft said the problem was concentrated in Exchange Online, its cloud email and calendar service, which also feeds Copilot, Teams and other Microsoft 365 tools. Full service was restored on the morning of 14 November. In the preliminary report issued to customers late on Sunday 16 November, Microsoft said three problems combined: a previously undetected defect that made networking gateway servers unresponsive under certain loads, a change in traffic allocation that increased the load, and maintenance that had cut the gateway fleet capacity by 14 percent. Automated rollback could not fix the defect because the change behind it was deployed in July 2026. Charles Lamanna, the Microsoft executive vice president who oversees the workplace software, apologised in a post on X. This is a follow-up to the outage itself, which we covered when it happened; see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/tech-ai'>Tech news</a> hub and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/microsoft-365-outage-outlook-teams-copilot-down-20261115'>Microsoft 365 outage report</a> from 15 November.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The cause is more worrying than the outage itself. A defect can sit in a system for four months and then be triggered by routine work, which is a reminder that the most widely used workplace software in the world rests on a single vendor's infrastructure. The outage was the second disruption to Microsoft's services this year and one of the longest in the company's history. Microsoft said the outage was not caused by a cyberattack and was not caused by AI, and the cascading failure was worsened by automated systems that rerouted traffic to servers they believed were healthy, spreading the fault further. Insured losses are estimated at 300 to 500 million dollars, well below the 400 million to 1.5 billion dollar toll of the 2024 CrowdStrike outage.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The report is preliminary, and the sources do not say what the July change was, or why four months of testing did not catch the defect. The sources do not give a figure for how many organisations were affected, only the 7.4 million Downdetector reports, which count reports rather than users. The sources do not say whether Microsoft will compensate affected customers.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.business-standard.com/amp/technology/tech-news/microsoft-bug-undetected-in-data-centres-since-july-triggered-global-outage-126111700158_1.html'>Business Standard</a>, reporting Bloomberg, for the root cause and the timeline; <a href='https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/microsoft-restore-full-service-outlook-teams-global-outage-6551486'>Channel News Asia</a> for the restoration, the report count and the loss estimate; <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Microsoft_outage'>Wikipedia</a> for the incident timeline and the incident numbers MO1550821 and EX1550543.</p>$$,
$$<p>१२ देखि १४ नोभेम्बर २०२६ सम्म चलेको माइक्रोसफ्ट आउटलुक अवरोध जुलाईदेखि लुकेको बगका कारण भएको माइक्रोसफ्टले बताएको छ। ११ नोभेम्बरमा नियमित ट्राफिक रिरुटिङ गर्दा बग सक्रिय भयो र सबैभन्दा खराब बेला आउटलुक पछाडिका ८० प्रतिशतभन्दा बढी सर्भरले काम गरेनन्। ७० भन्दा बढी देशबाट ७४ लाखभन्दा बढी अवरोध रिपोर्ट आए। यो साइबर आक्रमण थिएन। बीमित क्षति ३० देखि ५० करोड डलर अनुमान गरिएको छ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.business-standard.com/amp/technology/tech-news/microsoft-bug-undetected-in-data-centres-since-july-triggered-global-outage-126111700158_1.html', 'https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/microsoft-restore-full-service-outlook-teams-global-outage-6551486', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Microsoft_outage'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- gta-6-hackers-sentenced-crypto-theft-20261121 (tech-ai; English 498 words; Nepali 58 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'gta-6-hackers-sentenced-crypto-theft-20261121', 'tech-ai', 'UK',
'GTA 6 Hackers Face Prison Over Crypto Theft and Leaks',
'जीटीए ६ ह्याकरहरू क्रिप्टो चोरी र लिकमा जेल सजाय',
'GTA 6 hackers Tyler Buchanan and Arion Kurtaj face prison after a US court jailed Buchanan for six years over an 11 million dollar crypto phishing scheme.',
'जीटीए ६ ह्याकर टायलर बुकाननलाई अमेरिकी अदालतले ११ मिलियन डलर क्रिप्टो ठगीमा छ वर्षको जेल सजाय सुनाएको छ।',
$$<p>GTA 6 hackers Tyler Buchanan and Arion Kurtaj are facing long prison terms after two separate court actions this week. A US court sentenced Buchanan, 24, from Dundee in Scotland, to six years in prison for a phishing scheme that stole at least 11 million dollars in cryptocurrency, while Kurtaj, 21, from Oxford in England, pleaded guilty to cyberattacks including the theft of data from Rockstar Games and the leak of pre-release Grand Theft Auto VI footage.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Detail</th><th>The two cases</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tyler Buchanan</td><td>24, from Dundee, Scotland; six years in a US court</td></tr><tr><td>Buchanan offence</td><td>SMS phishing scheme stealing at least 11 million dollars in cryptocurrency</td></tr><tr><td>Arion Kurtaj</td><td>21, from Oxford, England; pleaded guilty, faces public trial</td></tr><tr><td>Kurtaj offence</td><td>Data theft and extortion of Rockstar Games; leaked GTA 6 footage</td></tr><tr><td>Groups involved</td><td>0ktapus, Lapsus$ and later Scattered Spider</td></tr><tr><td>GTA 6 release</td><td>18 November 2026, after several delays</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>GTA 6 hackers: what happened</h2><p>Buchanan was extradited to the United States in 2025 and sentenced this week by a US court. The US Department of Justice said he is the fifth and final defendant to be sentenced in the case. Prosecutors said he ran SMS phishing campaigns from 2021 that stole cryptocurrency from dozens of companies and individual investors. Kurtaj carried out his attacks as a teenager, including while he was confined to a hotel under police protection from rival criminal gangs. UK authorities confirmed he used an Amazon Fire TV stick to hack companies, breaching his bail conditions. A UK court had previously ordered Kurtaj to be detained indefinitely after deeming him unable to stand trial because of his autism diagnosis and the risk he posed, but UK authorities confirmed on Monday 16 November that he had admitted to several hacks and would face a public trial. For the game itself, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/tech-ai'>Tech news</a> hub and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/gta-6-release-date-time-how-to-play-20261119'>GTA 6 release date and how to play</a> guide.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The two cases close a long chapter in game-industry security. The GTA 6 leak was one of the most damaging in gaming history, and the fact that the footage was stolen by a teenager using a streaming stick, while under police protection, shows how little the attacks depended on advanced tools. Both men belonged to overlapping groups, 0ktapus, Lapsus$ and later Scattered Spider, which were behind hundreds of attacks on major companies between 2022 and 2024, including Coinbase, DoorDash and Nvidia. The sentences also land in the same week the game finally reached players, on 18 November after several delays, which gives the story a sharp edge: the people who leaked the game are being sentenced as the public plays it for the first time.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give a date for Kurtaj's public trial, and they do not say what sentence he may face. The sources do not say how much of the stolen cryptocurrency was recovered, and they do not break down the 11 million dollars by victim.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/18/british-hackers-face-prison-for-gta-6-data-breach-and-crypto-thefts/'>TechCrunch</a> for both cases, the sentences and the groups involved; <a href='https://www.newsbytesapp.com/news/science/british-hackers-jailed-for-stealing-crypto-leaking-gta-6-footage/story'>NewsBytes</a> for the case detail and the timeline.</p>$$,
$$<p>जीटीए ६ ह्याकर टायलर बुकाननलाई अमेरिकी अदालतले छ वर्षको जेल सजाय सुनाएको छ। २४ वर्षीय बुकाननले एसएमएस फिसिङबाट कम्तीमा ११ मिलियन डलरको क्रिप्टोकरेन्सी चोरेका थिए। अर्का ह्याकर एरियन कुर्ताज, २१, ले रकस्टार गेम्सबाट डाटा चोरी र जीटीए ६ को फुटेज लिक गरेको स्वीकार गरेका छन्। उनी अब सार्वजनिक मुद्दाको सामना गर्नेछन्। जीटीए ६ खेल १८ नोभेम्बरमा सार्वजनिक भयो।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/18/british-hackers-face-prison-for-gta-6-data-breach-and-crypto-thefts/', 'https://www.newsbytesapp.com/news/science/british-hackers-jailed-for-stealing-crypto-leaking-gta-6-footage/story'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- google-play-foldable-apps-rules-april-2027-20261121 (tech-ai; English 584 words; Nepali 57 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'google-play-foldable-apps-rules-april-2027-20261121', 'tech-ai', 'Global',
'Google Play Foldable App Rules Start in April 2027',
'गुगल प्ले फोल्डेबल एप नियम अप्रिल २०२७ देखि',
'Google Play foldable app rules will block new apps and updates from April 2027 unless they meet baseline adaptive quality and include foldable screenshots.',
'गुगल प्लेले अप्रिल २०२७ देखि फोल्डेबल फोनमा राम्रोसँग नचल्ने नयाँ एप र अपडेट रोक्ने भएको छ।',
$$<p>Google Play foldable app rules announced on 18 November 2026 will stop accepting new apps and updates from April 2027 unless they meet a baseline standard for foldable phones. Apps must fill the unfolded inner display properly and keep the user's place when the phone is folded or unfolded, and listings must include three foldable screenshots.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Milestone</th><th>What changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>November 2026, live now</td><td>Developers can upload foldable screenshots in Play Console; apps meeting Tier 2 or Tier 1 can apply for badging</td></tr><tr><td>April 2027</td><td>New apps and updates must meet Tier 3 adaptive quality and include 3 foldable screenshots plus 2 phone screenshots</td></tr><tr><td>August 2027</td><td>Games must meet Tier 3; new and updated apps must target API level 37, Android 17</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Google Play foldable: what happened</h2><p>Google announced the new adaptive app quality requirements on the Android Developers Blog on 18 November. The minimum standard is Tier 3, called Adaptive ready. An app at this level must fill the available display area without letterboxing or compatibility modes, and it must preserve state, including scroll position, typed text and media playback, across rotation, folding, unfolding and window resizing, and work in multi-window mode. The Tier 3 checklist also covers camera previews that stay in the right orientation and basic support for external keyboards, mice, trackpads and styluses. From April 2027, new apps and listing updates must include three foldable screenshots on top of the usual two phone screenshots, covering both 1:1 and 4:3 inner displays. Games get a separate set of rules with a later deadline of August 2027. The announcement comes weeks after Apple launched the iPhone Duo, its first foldable. For more on phones, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/tech-ai'>Tech news</a> hub and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/apple-ios-27-3-beta-2-siri-iphone-duo-20261118'>iOS 27.3 beta and iPhone Duo</a> article.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>This is Google using the Play Store as a lever to fix a long-standing complaint: too many Android apps still open on a foldable as a stretched phone screen with black bars. Developers who ignore the rules will not be able to publish or update their apps after April 2027, although existing apps that are not updated will stay downloadable. The higher tiers stay optional for now: Tier 2, Adaptive optimized, covers multi-pane layouts, and Tier 1, Adaptive differentiated, covers tabletop and book postures and running multiple instances of an app. Google says its quality framework will gradually add Tier 2 and Tier 1 standards across foldables, tablets, Chromebooks and Android XR. The August 2027 requirement to target API level 37, Android 17, also removes developer opt-outs for orientation and resizability restrictions on large screens.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not say how Google will test apps against the Tier 3 checklist, or whether automated checks will be enough. The sources do not say what happens to apps that meet the rules on one foldable shape but not the other, and they do not give a date for Tier 2 or Tier 1 becoming mandatory.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://developer.android.com/blog/posts/google-play-adaptive-quality-standards'>Android Developers Blog</a>, the official announcement, for the rules and the timeline; <a href='https://www.talkandroid.com/535678-google-play-foldable-app-requirements-april-2027/'>TalkAndroid</a> for the developer impact and the iPhone Duo context; <a href='https://www.neowin.net/news/google-is-forcing-android-developers-to-provide-at-least-baseline-support-for-foldables/'>Neowin</a> for the enforcement detail; <a href='https://omnistu.com/blog/google-play-adaptive-quality-requirements-2027/'>Omnistu</a> for the dates and the open questions.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Will my existing apps disappear from Google Play in April 2027?</h3><p>No. Google says existing apps that are not updated will remain downloadable, but new apps and updates must meet the Tier 3 baseline and include the foldable screenshots.</p><h3>Do games face the same April 2027 deadline?</h3><p>No. Games must meet their Tier 3 standard by August 2027, when apps must also target API level 37, Android 17.</p>$$,
$$<p>गुगलले १८ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा घोषणा गर्‍यो कि अप्रिल २०२७ देखि फोल्डेबल फोनमा राम्रोसँग नचल्ने नयाँ एप र अपडेट गुगल प्लेले स्वीकार गर्ने छैन। एपले फोल्ड गरिएको भित्री डिस्प्ले पूर्ण रूपमा भर्नुपर्छ र फोन फोल्ड गर्दा प्रयोगकर्ताको स्थान जोगाउनुपर्छ। सूचीमा तीनवटा फोल्डेबल स्क्रिनसट पनि चाहिन्छ। गेमका लागि म्याद अगस्ट २०२७ हो। पुराना एप डाउनलोड गर्न भने पाइनेछ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://developer.android.com/blog/posts/google-play-adaptive-quality-standards', 'https://www.talkandroid.com/535678-google-play-foldable-app-requirements-april-2027/', 'https://www.neowin.net/news/google-is-forcing-android-developers-to-provide-at-least-baseline-support-for-foldables/', 'https://omnistu.com/blog/google-play-adaptive-quality-requirements-2027/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- tesla-cybercab-dallas-rides-20261121 (tech-ai; English 525 words; Nepali 58 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'tesla-cybercab-dallas-rides-20261121', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'Tesla Cybercab Rides Begin in Dallas With V1.5 Cars',
'टेस्ला साइबरक्याब सवारी डलासमा भी१.५ गाडीसहित सुरु',
'Tesla Cybercab rides began in Dallas on 19 November, the second city after Austin to get the steering wheel-free robotaxi, with upgraded V1.5 vehicles.',
'टेस्ला साइबरक्याब सवारी १९ नोभेम्बरमा डलासमा सुरु भयो, अस्टिनपछि दोस्रो सहर, भी१.५ गाडीसहित।',
$$<p>Tesla Cybercab rides began in Dallas on 19 November 2026, making it the second city after Austin where the public can hail the purpose-built, steering wheel-free robotaxi. Tesla announced the launch on its Robotaxi account on X with the words "Howdy Dallas. Cybercab has arrived in your city." Riders book through the Tesla Robotaxi app.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Detail</th><th>Tesla Cybercab in Dallas</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Launch date</td><td>19 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>City number</td><td>Second, after Austin</td></tr><tr><td>Vehicle</td><td>Two-seat Cybercab, no steering wheel or pedals, butterfly doors</td></tr><tr><td>Version</td><td>Cybercab V1.5, per Tesla Robotaxi engineering chief Eric Earley</td></tr><tr><td>Dallas service area</td><td>About 81 square miles for Robotaxi, as of 16 November</td></tr><tr><td>Registered Cybercabs in Texas</td><td>773, after 200 more registered on 17 November</td></tr><tr><td>Personal purchase price</td><td>29,990 dollars plus 299 dollars a month Autonomy Subscription</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Tesla Cybercab: what happened</h2><p>Tesla had already run unsupervised Model Y robotaxis in Dallas since April, and the Dallas Robotaxi area grew from 31 square miles to 81 in late August. The Cybercab addition brings the dedicated two-seat vehicle into the same network. Cybercab chief engineer Eric Earley called the Dallas cars Cybercab V1.5, although Tesla has not said what changed. Riders have spotted two possible upgrades: a Starlink dish integrated into the rear of the roof, and a camera in the rear trunk lid. Tesla has not confirmed whether either feature is new or what the camera is for, and the Starlink panel has been fitted at the factory since at least September. One rider reported a 20-minute loop ride costing 11 dollars. Tesla has also opened Cybercab orders to individual buyers at 29,990 dollars plus a 299 dollar monthly Autonomy Subscription, with deliveries expected before the end of the year. For more on Tesla's robotaxis, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/tech-ai'>Tech news</a> hub and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/tesla-robotaxi-san-antonio-fort-worth-20261120'>Tesla Robotaxi in San Antonio and Fort Worth</a> article.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>Dallas is the test of whether the Cybercab can move beyond Austin. The vehicle is built for this job alone, with no steering wheel, no pedals and room for two passengers, and Tesla is now running it in a second city while also selling it to private buyers. The pace is quick: Austin public rides began only in early September, and Tesla said it had more than 300 Cybercabs running there. The open questions are regulatory as much as technical. It is still unclear how a car with no steering wheel or pedals meets Federal Motor Vehicle Safety Standards for private ownership, and Tesla has not published the Cybercab's Dallas service area or said how many of the cars are in service there.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not say how many Cybercabs are operating in Dallas, or whether they serve the full 81-square-mile area. The sources do not confirm that the V1.5 upgrades spotted by riders are new, and the 11 dollar fare comes from a single rider report rather than Tesla. The sources do not give a delivery date for private Cybercab orders beyond before the end of the year.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.teslarati.com/tesla-cybercab-without-steering-wheel-pedals-expands-public-rides-dallas/'>Teslarati</a> for the launch, the Robotaxi post and the purchase price; <a href='https://insideevs.com/news/816139/tesla-cybercab-robotaxi-expands-to-dallas/'>InsideEVs</a> for the service detail and the safety standards question; <a href='https://www.notateslaapp.com/news/5044/tesla-launches-cybercab-rides-in-dallas-with-new-v15-design'>Not a Tesla App</a> for the V1.5 detail and the rider reports; <a href='https://eletric-vehicles.com/tesla/tesla-launches-cybercab-rides-in-dallas-with-upgraded-v1-5-version/'>Electric Vehicles</a> for the service area and registration figures.</p>$$,
$$<p>टेस्ला साइबरक्याब सवारी १९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा डलासमा सुरु भयो। अस्टिनपछि यो दोस्रो सहर हो जहाँ सर्वसाधारणले स्टेयरिङ ह्विल नभएको रोबोट्याक्सी चढ्न सक्छन्। डलासका गाडीलाई भी१.५ भनिएको छ। सवारीले छतमा स्टारलिङ्क डिश र पछाडिको ट्रंकमा क्यामेरा देखिएको छ, तर टेस्लाले यी नयाँ हुन् भनी पुष्टि गरेको छैन। व्यक्तिगत खरिद मूल्य २९,९९० डलर र मासिक २९९ डलर सदस्यता छ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.teslarati.com/tesla-cybercab-without-steering-wheel-pedals-expands-public-rides-dallas/', 'https://insideevs.com/news/816139/tesla-cybercab-robotaxi-expands-to-dallas/', 'https://www.notateslaapp.com/news/5044/tesla-launches-cybercab-rides-in-dallas-with-new-v15-design', 'https://eletric-vehicles.com/tesla/tesla-launches-cybercab-rides-in-dallas-with-upgraded-v1-5-version/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- chatgpt-for-accounting-plugin-launch-20261121 (tech-ai; English 485 words; Nepali 48 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'chatgpt-for-accounting-plugin-launch-20261121', 'tech-ai', 'Global',
'ChatGPT for Accounting Launches With QuickBooks Link',
'च्याटजीपीटी फर अकाउन्टिङ क्विकबुक्स लिंकसहित सार्वजनिक',
'ChatGPT for Accounting launched this week, connecting the chatbot to QuickBooks, Xero and NetSuite so finance teams can reconcile books and close the month.',
'च्याटजीपीटी फर अकाउन्टिङ यस साता सार्वजनिक भयो, क्विकबुक्स, जेरो र नेटसुइटसँग जोडिँदै।',
$$<p>ChatGPT for Accounting launched this week, giving finance teams a dedicated plugin that connects ChatGPT to their accounting software. The plugin can draft invoice entries, reconcile bank statements against ledgers, build month-end reports and help prepare for audits, working with QuickBooks Online, Xero, Oracle NetSuite, BILL, FreshBooks, Rillet, Campfire and Oracle QuickStart.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Detail</th><th>ChatGPT for Accounting</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Launch</td><td>Announced 18 November 2026, reported 19 November</td></tr><tr><td>Plugin version</td><td>1.0.0</td></tr><tr><td>Who can install it</td><td>ChatGPT Business users can download it; Enterprise needs administrator approval</td></tr><tr><td>Partner integrations</td><td>QuickBooks Online, Xero, Oracle NetSuite, BILL, FreshBooks, Rillet, Campfire, Oracle QuickStart</td></tr><tr><td>Core tasks</td><td>Invoice processing, bank reconciliation, month-end reports, data entry, audit preparation</td></tr><tr><td>Guardrail</td><td>Final entries need human approval; data changes need a person to confirm</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>ChatGPT for Accounting: what happened</h2><p>OpenAI announced the plugin through the official ChatGPT account on X, alongside an improvement to live dictation that shows text as you speak. The Accounting plugin itself supplies guidance for accounting tasks, while the partner plugins decide what records ChatGPT can access and what actions it can take in each service. Installing the main plugin does not automatically grant access to a company's books. FreshBooks said its connection is read-only: it can retrieve live data to answer questions, such as which invoices are overdue or which expenses are missing receipts, but it cannot change anything in a FreshBooks account. For more on OpenAI, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/tech-ai'>Tech news</a> hub and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/openai-gpt-6-2-astra-sol-launch-20261120'>GPT-6.2 Astra and Sol launch</a> article.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>This is OpenAI moving ChatGPT from answering questions into doing routine back-office work, and the accounting market is a large one to aim at. The design is deliberately cautious: final entries still need a human sign-off, and at least one partner connection is read-only by design. That matters because the plugin works with sensitive financial data, and firms will need to check data handling, access controls and how suggested entries are reviewed before they connect their books. The launch also shows OpenAI building ChatGPT as a platform of specialist plugins rather than a single chatbot, with eight partner integrations at launch.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources disagree on the launch date: Dataconomy and Crypto Briefing date the launch to 18 November, while Gadgets 360 reports the announcement on Thursday 19 November. The sources do not say what the plugin costs, or whether it will come to ChatGPT Plus or free users. The sources do not say which partner integrations are read-only and which can write entries, beyond FreshBooks.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.gadgets360.com/ai/news/openai-chatgpt-live-dictation-update-release-accounting-features-12349148'>Gadgets 360</a> for the launch and the partner list; <a href='https://www.techbooky.com/openai-launches-chatgpt-for-accounting-with-quickbooks-and-xero-plugins/'>TechBooky</a> for the setup rules and the Business and Enterprise difference; <a href='https://dataconomy.com/2026/11/19/openai-launches-chatgpt-for-accounting-with-finance/'>Dataconomy</a> for the launch date and the human-approval guardrail; <a href='https://rss.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/11/19/3406729/0/en/freshbooks-partners-with-openai-to-release-chatgpt-for-accounting-bringing-ai-innovation-to-small-business-owners.html'>GlobeNewswire</a> for the FreshBooks read-only detail.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Who can use ChatGPT for Accounting?</h3><p>ChatGPT Business users can download the plugin now. Enterprise workspaces need an administrator to approve it first.</p><h3>Can ChatGPT change my accounting records?</h3><p>Final entries need human approval, and data changes need a person to confirm them. The FreshBooks connection is read-only and cannot change anything.</p>$$,
$$<p>च्याटजीपीटी फर अकाउन्टिङ यस साता सार्वजनिक भयो। यसले च्याटजीपीटीलाई क्विकबुक्स, जेरो, नेटसुइट, फ्रेसबुक्सलगायत लेखा सफ्टवेयरसँग जोड्छ। यसले इन्भ्वाइस तयार गर्न, बैंक हिसाब मिलाउन, महिनाको अन्तिम रिपोर्ट बनाउन र अडिट तयारीमा सहयोग गर्छ। अन्तिम प्रविष्टिका लागि मानिसको स्वीकृति चाहिन्छ। बिजनेस प्रयोगकर्ताले अहिले डाउनलोड गर्न सक्छन्, इन्टरप्राइजमा प्रशासकको स्वीकृति चाहिन्छ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.gadgets360.com/ai/news/openai-chatgpt-live-dictation-update-release-accounting-features-12349148', 'https://www.techbooky.com/openai-launches-chatgpt-for-accounting-with-quickbooks-and-xero-plugins/', 'https://dataconomy.com/2026/11/19/openai-launches-chatgpt-for-accounting-with-finance/', 'https://rss.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/11/19/3406729/0/en/freshbooks-partners-with-openai-to-release-chatgpt-for-accounting-bringing-ai-innovation-to-small-business-owners.html'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- ao3-returns-after-17-days-outage-20261121 (tech-ai; English 550 words; Nepali 60 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'ao3-returns-after-17-days-outage-20261121', 'tech-ai', 'Global',
'AO3 Returns After 17 Days Offline After Security Breach',
'एओ३ सुरक्षा उल्लंघनपछि १७ दिन बन्द भएर फर्कियो',
'AO3 returns after 17 days offline following a security incident, with some features still disabled, and went down again briefly on 19 November for maintenance.',
'एओ३ सुरक्षा घटनापछि १७ दिन बन्द भएर फर्कियो, केही सुविधा अझै बन्द छन्, र १९ नोभेम्बरमा फेरि केही घण्टा बन्द भयो।',
$$<p>AO3 returns after 17 days offline following a security incident, with the fanfiction archive back online on 15 November 2026 in a degraded state. The Archive of Our Own went down on 29 October, and the Organization for Transformative Works, the nonprofit that runs it, said on 30 October that it had detected evidence of a security incident. The site then went down again on 19 November for about 12 hours of preventative maintenance.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Detail</th><th>AO3 outage, 2026</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Outage began</td><td>29 October 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Security incident disclosed</td><td>30 October, 01:27 UTC</td></tr><tr><td>Returned online</td><td>15 November 2026, degraded service</td></tr><tr><td>Features still disabled</td><td>User and collection icons, external work importing, downloads except HTML</td></tr><tr><td>Invitation queue reopened</td><td>17 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Second downtime</td><td>19 November, 11:27 to 23:47 UTC, preventative maintenance</td></tr><tr><td>Draft deletion resumes</td><td>29 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Archive size</td><td>About 18.5 million works across nearly 83,000 fandoms</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>AO3 returns: what happened</h2><p>AO3 first went down on 29 October for what was described as maintenance, with an early estimate of about 12 hours. Within a day the estimate grew to two to four weeks, and on 30 October the Organization for Transformative Works disclosed evidence of a security incident. The archive came back on 15 November, sooner than the four-week estimate, because some features were switched off to bring it back earlier. User and collection icons are hidden, external work importing is unavailable, and works can only be downloaded in HTML format. On 19 November the site went offline again from 11:27 UTC until 23:47 UTC for preventative maintenance, and the Organization for Transformative Works has not said what was maintained or whether it was connected to the security incident. For more on this week of outages, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/tech-ai'>Tech news</a> hub and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/us-tech-outages-five-days-chase-united-apple-20261120'>US tech outages in five days</a> article.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The outage was the longest in the archive's 17-year history, and it hit a community that treats the site as a library: about 18.5 million works across nearly 83,000 fandoms. The return is good news for readers, but the degraded state and the second downtime show the recovery is not finished. The security questions matter most. The Organization for Transformative Works says no works, bookmarks or kudos were deleted, and it has no reason to believe the user database was compromised, but it still cannot rule that out. The database may hold usernames, email addresses, IP addresses and hashed passwords. The nonprofit has partnered with a security firm to review what happened, and it has told users to change their AO3 password and any other password they reused elsewhere. Draft deletion was paused during the outage and is set to resume on 29 November, so users should save or publish drafts they want to keep.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not identify who was responsible or how the intruder gained access, and the Organization for Transformative Works has not confirmed a break-in method or whether any data was stolen. The sources do not say when the disabled features will return. The detail of the 19 November maintenance window comes from a single report, Nacionale, reading the official status page, so treat the exact times as reported rather than confirmed by the Organization for Transformative Works itself.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.dexerto.com/entertainment/ao3-returns-after-17-days-offline-following-security-incident-3428313/'>Dexerto</a> for the return and the disabled features; <a href='http://fanlore.org/wiki/2026_AO3_Major_Outage'>Fanlore</a> for the outage timeline; <a href='https://www.nacionale.com/en/articles/is-ao3-down-again-preventative-maintenance-november-19'>Nacionale</a> for the 19 November maintenance window; <a href='https://newsdive.net/2026/11/14/ao3-s-prolonged-outage-what-fans-should-know-about-the-disruption-and-clone-sites/'>News Dive</a> for the archive size and the clone-site warning.</p>$$,
$$<p>एओ३ सुरक्षा घटनापछि १७ दिन बन्द भएर १५ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा फर्कियो, तर केही सुविधा अझै बन्द छन्। साइट २९ अक्टोबरमा बन्द भएको थियो र ३० अक्टोबरमा सुरक्षा उल्लंघनको प्रमाण भेटिएको बताइएको थियो। प्रयोगकर्ता आइकन, बाह्य आयात र एचटीएमएलबाहेक डाउनलोड अझै बन्द छन्। १९ नोभेम्बरमा साइट फेरि करिब १२ घण्टा मर्मतका लागि बन्द भयो। प्रयोगकर्तालाई पासवर्ड परिवर्तन गर्न भनिएको छ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.dexerto.com/entertainment/ao3-returns-after-17-days-offline-following-security-incident-3428313/', 'http://fanlore.org/wiki/2026_AO3_Major_Outage', 'https://www.nacionale.com/en/articles/is-ao3-down-again-preventative-maintenance-november-19', 'https://newsdive.net/2026/11/14/ao3-s-prolonged-outage-what-fans-should-know-about-the-disruption-and-clone-sites/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- spacex-falcon-9-nrol-136-launch-preview-20261121 (tech-ai; English 467 words; Nepali 49 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'spacex-falcon-9-nrol-136-launch-preview-20261121', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'SpaceX Falcon 9 NROL-136 Launch: What to Watch on 21 November',
'स्पेसएक्स फाल्कन ९ एनआरओएल-१३६ प्रक्षेपण: २१ नोभेम्बरमा के हेर्ने',
'SpaceX Falcon 9 NROL-136 launch is scheduled for 21 November from Vandenberg, carrying reconnaissance satellites for the National Reconnaissance Office.',
'स्पेसएक्स फाल्कन ९ एनआरओएल-१३६ प्रक्षेपण २१ नोभेम्बरमा भ्यान्डेनबर्गबाट हुने तालिका छ।',
$$<p>SpaceX Falcon 9 NROL-136 launch is scheduled for Saturday 21 November 2026 at 12:30 UTC from Space Launch Complex 4E at Vandenberg Space Force Base in California. The Falcon 9 will carry a classified batch of reconnaissance satellites for the United States National Reconnaissance Office, and the first stage is due to return to Landing Zone 4. This is a preview: the launch has not happened yet, and the outcome is not known.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Detail</th><th>Falcon 9 NROL-136</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Scheduled launch</td><td>21 November 2026, 12:30 UTC</td></tr><tr><td>Launch site</td><td>Space Launch Complex 4E, Vandenberg Space Force Base, California</td></tr><tr><td>Rocket</td><td>Falcon 9 Block 5</td></tr><tr><td>Payload</td><td>Classified batch of reconnaissance satellites for the National Reconnaissance Office</td></tr><tr><td>Satellites built by</td><td>SpaceX and Northrop Grumman</td></tr><tr><td>Booster recovery</td><td>Planned return to Landing Zone 4</td></tr><tr><td>Also on 21 November</td><td>Long March 6C from Taiyuan, China, at 03:50 UTC, payload unknown</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Falcon 9 NROL-136: what to watch</h2><p>NROL-136 is the fifteenth batch of satellites for the National Reconnaissance Office's proliferated architecture constellation, a network of imaging and reconnaissance satellites built by SpaceX and Northrop Grumman. Because the payload is classified, there will be no public detail on the satellites themselves, and the webcast is likely to end coverage after the first stage separates. The watchable moment is the booster: the Falcon 9 first stage is due back at Landing Zone 4, and a clean landing would continue a run of routine recoveries. The launch is one of four scheduled for the weekend of 20 to 22 November, alongside the Falcon 9 USSF-317 mission and a Long March 8A flight on 20 November, and a Long March 6C from Taiyuan at 03:50 UTC on 21 November. For more on SpaceX, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/tech-ai'>Tech news</a> hub and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/spacex-starship-flight-15-first-catch-20261119'>SpaceX Starship Flight 15 first catch</a> article.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The NRO constellation is the quiet side of the space business: dozens of small reconnaissance satellites launched in batches, with little public detail and a steady tempo. The mission matters less for spectacle than for what it shows about launch cadence. SpaceX is flying national-security missions from Vandenberg several times a month, and the booster recovery is now routine enough that a failure would be the news. The weekend also shows the parallel tempo from China, with two Long March launches scheduled in the same window.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>This article is a preview written before the launch, so no outcome is claimed: the launch could slip, and schedules change often. The sources do not say how many satellites are on board, what their capabilities are, or which booster is flying. The Long March 6C payload is listed as unknown. If the launch slips past 21 November, this article will need a correction.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.nasanow.org/launches'>NASANOW</a> for the launch schedule and times; <a href='https://www.flightatlas.org/future-launches'>Flight Atlas</a> for the mission detail and the booster landing plan; <a href='https://starryspots.com/events'>StarrySpots</a> for the payload description; <a href='https://realtimesolarsystem.com/en/launches/this-weekend/'>RealTime Solar System</a> for the weekend launch list.</p>$$,
$$<p>स्पेसएक्स फाल्कन ९ एनआरओएल-१३६ प्रक्षेपण २१ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा १२:३० यूटीसीमा भ्यान्डेनबर्गबाट हुने तालिका छ। यसले अमेरिकी राष्ट्रिय टोही कार्यालयका लागि वर्गीकृत टोही उपग्रहहरू लैजानेछ। पहिलो चरण ल्यान्डिङ जोन ४ मा फर्कने योजना छ। यो पूर्वावलोकन हो: प्रक्षेपण अझै भएको छैन र नतिजा थाहा छैन। तालिका परिवर्तन हुन सक्छ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.nasanow.org/launches', 'https://www.flightatlas.org/future-launches', 'https://starryspots.com/events', 'https://realtimesolarsystem.com/en/launches/this-weekend/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- uk-data-management-lead-jobs-7-posts-20261122 (uk; English 662 words; Nepali 383 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-20'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'uk-data-management-lead-jobs-7-posts-20261122', 'uk', 'UK',
'UK Data Management Lead Jobs: 7 Posts at MoJ Justice Digital',
'बेलायत डाटा व्यवस्थापन प्रमुख जागिर: MoJ मा ७ पद',
'UK data management lead jobs: 7 Grade 7 posts at MoJ Justice Digital pay up to £70,725 in London. Apply by 28 November 2026.',
'बेलायत डाटा व्यवस्थापन प्रमुख जागिर: MoJ जस्टिस डिजिटलमा ७ ग्रेड ७ पद, लन्डनमा तलब £70,725 सम्म। २८ नोभेम्बर २०२६ सम्म आवेदन दिनुहोस्।',
$$<p>The Ministry of Justice is hiring for UK data management lead jobs, with 7 Grade 7 Data Management Lead posts in Justice Digital, Data and Science. Applications close on 28 November 2026, and interviews are scheduled for the week commencing 7 December 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Ministry of Justice, Justice Digital, Data and Science</td></tr><tr><td>Total posts</td><td>7 Data Management Lead posts, Grade 7, reference 23803</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>National £58,511 to £65,329; London £63,343 to £70,725</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Closing 28 November 2026; interviews week commencing 7 December 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through Civil Service Jobs</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>CV and a personal statement of no more than 750 words</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Success Profiles: Experience, Technical skills and Behaviours, then interview</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the data management lead job involves</h2><p>Data Management Leads in Justice Digital, Data and Science help shape how data is looked after, understood and used across the Ministry of Justice. The team is distributed across business areas, and the work covers the full life of the data the department holds, from quality and standards to making it usable for the people who need it. The advert describes the team as warm and collaborative, and the role sits at Grade 7, a senior specialist level. The post is hybrid, combining remote work with time in a local office, and the Civil Service pension and flexible working options that come with a Ministry of Justice post apply. Readers looking for other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/uk">UK jobs</a> on Growentix can also read our report on the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/hmrc-tax-specialist-programme-500-posts-20261025">HMRC Tax Specialist Programme</a>, another large UK government recruitment.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>The advert does not set a single degree or profession as a condition. Applicants are assessed on experience, technical skill and behaviours under the Civil Service Success Profiles framework, so candidates need evidence of data management work at a senior level: setting standards, improving data quality, and helping teams use data well. The application asks for a CV showing career history against the essential criteria in the person specification, and a personal statement of no more than 750 words giving examples of work undertaken. The only London location being recruited to is 10 South Colonnade, E14 4PU; the advert states the department is no longer recruiting to 102 Petty France for this role.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>Pay is £58,511 to £65,329 a year for national locations and £63,343 to £70,725 a year in London. The advert does not break the range down by individual office, and it does not state a starting point within the band, so applicants should expect appointment somewhere in the advertised range depending on experience and location.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply online through Civil Service Jobs, searching for vacancy reference 23803, Data Management Lead. Submit a CV and a personal statement of no more than 750 words before the closing date of 28 November 2026. Shortlisted candidates are interviewed in the week commencing 7 December 2026. Questions about the recruitment go to digitalanddatarecruitment@justice.gov.uk.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The advert does not say how the 7 posts are split between locations, and it does not give a start date. It does not state whether visa sponsorship is available, and it does not list every office location, only that the model is hybrid with a local office base. The interview week is indicative and could change.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> Civil Service Jobs applications are free, and the Ministry of Justice will never ask for money in exchange for an application, an interview or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/jobs.cgi?jcode=23803">Civil Service Jobs</a>, the official vacancy advert (post count, pay, closing date, interview week and application requirements).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How many data management lead posts are open?</h3><p>Seven posts are open, all at Grade 7 in Justice Digital, Data and Science.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>Applications close on 28 November 2026, and interviews are scheduled for the week commencing 7 December 2026.</p><h3>Is the role hybrid?</h3><p>Yes. The advert offers a hybrid working model, combining remote work with time in a local office.</p><h3>What must I submit with my application?</h3><p>A CV and a personal statement of no more than 750 words, assessed against the essential criteria in the person specification.</p>$$,
$$<p>न्याय मन्त्रालयले बेलायत डाटा व्यवस्थापन प्रमुख जागिरका लागि जस्टिस डिजिटल, डाटा र विज्ञानमा ७ ग्रेड ७ डाटा व्यवस्थापन प्रमुख पदका लागि आवेदन खुलाएको छ। आवेदन २८ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा बन्द हुन्छ र अन्तर्वार्ता ७ डिसेम्बर २०२६ बाट सुरु हुने हप्तामा हुनेछ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>न्याय मन्त्रालय, जस्टिस डिजिटल, डाटा र विज्ञान</td></tr><tr><td>कुल पद</td><td>७ डाटा व्यवस्थापन प्रमुख पद, ग्रेड ७, सन्दर्भ २३८०३</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>राष्ट्रिय £58,511 देखि £65,329; लन्डन £63,343 देखि £70,725</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>२८ नोभेम्बर २०२६ सम्म; अन्तर्वार्ता ७ डिसेम्बर २०२६ बाट सुरु हुने हप्ता</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>सिभिल सर्भिस जब्सबाट अनलाइन</td></tr><tr><td>योग्यता</td><td>CV र ७५० शब्दभन्दा बढी नहुने व्यक्तिगत विवरण</td></tr><tr><td>छनोट</td><td>सक्सेस प्रोफाइल: अनुभव, प्राविधिक सीप र व्यवहार, त्यसपछि अन्तर्वार्ता</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>जस्टिस डिजिटल, डाटा र विज्ञानका डाटा व्यवस्थापन प्रमुखहरूले न्याय मन्त्रालयमा डाटा कसरी हेरचाह गरिन्छ, बुझिन्छ र प्रयोग गरिन्छ भन्ने कुरालाई आकार दिन्छन्। यो टोली विभिन्न व्यापार क्षेत्रमा फैलिएको छ र काम डाटाको गुणस्तर र मापदण्डदेखि प्रयोगसम्म फैलिएको छ। यो पद हाइब्रिड हो, टाढाबाट काम र स्थानीय कार्यालयको संयोजनसहित।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>विज्ञापनले एउटै डिग्री वा पेशा सर्तका रूपमा तोकेको छैन। उम्मेदवारको मूल्याङ्कन सिभिल सर्भिस सक्सेस प्रोफाइल ढाँचाअन्तर्गत अनुभव, प्राविधिक सीप र व्यवहारका आधारमा हुन्छ, त्यसैले वरिष्ठ तहमा डाटा व्यवस्थापन कार्यको प्रमाण चाहिन्छ। आवेदनमा व्यक्ति विवरणमा उल्लेखित आवश्यक मापदण्डअनुसार करियर इतिहास देखाउने CV र ७५० शब्दभन्दा बढी नहुने व्यक्तिगत विवरण चाहिन्छ।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>राष्ट्रिय स्थानका लागि तलब वार्षिक £58,511 देखि £65,329 र लन्डनका लागि £63,343 देखि £70,725 छ। विज्ञापनले ब्यान्डभित्रको सुरुवाती बिन्दु बताएको छैन।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>सिभिल सर्भिस जब्सबाट अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्, रिक्ति सन्दर्भ २३८०३, डाटा व्यवस्थापन प्रमुख खोजेर। २८ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को अन्तिम मितिअघि CV र ७५० शब्दभन्दा बढी नहुने व्यक्तिगत विवरण पेस गर्नुहोस्। छोटो सूचीमा परेका उम्मेदवारको अन्तर्वार्ता ७ डिसेम्बर २०२६ बाट सुरु हुने हप्तामा हुन्छ।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>विज्ञापनले ७ पद स्थानअनुसार कसरी बाँडिएका छन् भन्ने बताएको छैन र सुरु मिति पनि दिएको छैन। भिसा प्रायोजन उपलब्ध छ कि छैन भन्ने पनि बताएको छैन।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> सिभिल सर्भिस जब्समा आवेदन निःशुल्क छ, र न्याय मन्त्रालयले आवेदन, अन्तर्वार्ता वा जागिर प्रस्तावका लागि कहिल्यै पैसा माग्दैन।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/jobs.cgi?jcode=23803">सिभिल सर्भिस जब्स</a>, आधिकारिक रिक्ति विज्ञापन (पद सङ्ख्या, तलब, अन्तिम मिति, अन्तर्वार्ता हप्ता र आवेदन आवश्यकता)।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>कति डाटा व्यवस्थापन प्रमुख पद खुलेका छन्?</h3><p>७ पद खुलेका छन्, सबै जस्टिस डिजिटल, डाटा र विज्ञानमा ग्रेड ७ मा।</p><h3>आवेदन कहिले बन्द हुन्छ?</h3><p>आवेदन २८ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा बन्द हुन्छ र अन्तर्वार्ता ७ डिसेम्बर २०२६ बाट सुरु हुने हप्तामा हुन्छ।</p><h3>के यो पद हाइब्रिड हो?</h3><p>हो। विज्ञापनले टाढाबाट काम र स्थानीय कार्यालयको संयोजनसहितको हाइब्रिड कार्य मोडेल प्रस्ताव गर्छ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/jobs.cgi?jcode=23803'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-20'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- gld-costs-lawyer-jobs-5-posts-20261122 (uk; English 690 words; Nepali 398 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-20'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'gld-costs-lawyer-jobs-5-posts-20261122', 'uk', 'UK',
'GLD Costs Lawyer Jobs: 5 SEO and HEO Posts, Closes 23 November',
'GLD कस्ट्स वकिल जागिर: ५ SEO र HEO पद',
'GLD costs lawyer jobs: 5 SEO and HEO posts in Croydon, Leeds, London and Manchester, pay up to £49,314. Apply by noon 23 November.',
'GLD कस्ट्स वकिल जागिर: क्रोइडन, लिड्स, लन्डन र म्यानचेस्टरमा ५ SEO र HEO पद, तलब £49,314 सम्म। २३ नोभेम्बर दिउँसो १२ बजेसम्म आवेदन दिनुहोस्।',
$$<p>The Government Legal Department is hiring for GLD costs lawyer jobs, with 5 Costs Lawyer and Draftsperson posts open across its Costs team at Senior Executive Officer and Higher Executive Officer grades. Applications close at noon on Monday 23 November 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Government Legal Department, Litigation Directorate, Costs team</td></tr><tr><td>Total posts</td><td>5 Costs Lawyer and Draftsperson posts, SEO and HEO grades</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>SEO £47,850 national, £49,314 Croydon and London; HEO £36,553 national, £38,780 Croydon and London; plus allowances up to £6,174 a year for qualified Costs Lawyers</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Closing noon, Monday 23 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through Civil Service Jobs, reference 489298</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>Costs Lawyer qualification or experience in costs work, by grade</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Online application and eligibility form, then assessment</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the costs lawyer job involves</h2><p>The Costs team sits in the Litigation Directorate of the Government Legal Department, which delivers litigation services to most UK government departments and many other public bodies. The team is a designated Centre of Excellence for legal costs work, and it works with litigation colleagues from an early stage of a case. Post holders manage a caseload of costs matters and are likely to line manage a more junior member of the team. The SEO post carries extra responsibility for supervising staff and client relationships, and the post holder is expected to handle cases largely on their own, with support available. The roles are based in Croydon, Leeds, London and Manchester, on a hybrid pattern. Readers following other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/uk">UK jobs</a> may also want our report on the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/hmrc-tax-specialist-programme-500-posts-20261025">HMRC Tax Specialist Programme</a>, another UK government recruitment with a fixed closing date.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>The SEO post suits a newly qualified Costs Lawyer or an experienced Draftsperson with proven technical skills and a varied caseload. The HEO post suits someone with some experience in costs work. Both grades need the judgement to manage costs matters and to develop junior team members and processes. The advert does not set a minimum number of years for either grade, so applicants should show the depth of their costs experience in the application form rather than relying on a job title alone.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>SEO pay is £47,850 a year nationally and £49,314 in Croydon and London. HEO pay is £36,553 nationally and £38,780 in Croydon and London. The Costs team also runs a recruitment and retention scheme: £1,500 a year is paid to staff who perform at least to a satisfactory standard, a further £1,544 a year is paid to staff who commit to study for the Costs Lawyer Professional Qualification, and qualified Costs Lawyers receive £6,174 a year inclusive of all other allowances.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply online through Civil Service Jobs, searching for reference 489298, before noon on Monday 23 November 2026. Take care with the eligibility sections of the form: the advert says mistakes can only be fixed if you contact the team more than two working days before the vacancy closes, at activecampaigns@governmentlegal.gov.uk. The advert does not give an interview date, so shortlisted candidates should watch for contact from the Government Legal Department after the closing date.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The advert does not say how the 5 posts are split between SEO and HEO grades, or between the four locations. It does not give interview dates, a start date, or whether visa sponsorship is available. The allowance figures are annual amounts paid on top of salary only where the stated conditions are met.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> Civil Service Jobs applications are free, and the Government Legal Department will never ask for money in exchange for an application, an interview or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/index.cgi?SID=c2VhcmNoc29ydD1zY29yZSZ1c2Vyc2VhcmNoY29udGV4dD0yMTk1MDgzNjYmc2VhcmNocGFnZT0xJm93bmVyPTUwNzAwMDAmam9ibGlzdF92aWV3X3ZhYz0yMDIwNTYxJnBhZ2VjbGFzcz1Kb2JzJnBhZ2VhY3Rpb249dmlld3ZhY2J5am9ibGlzdCZvd25lcnR5cGU9ZmFpciZyZXFzaWc9MTc5NDIyMTU5My04N2M3NzQ1ZjU5Y2QzYWE1NTljMjhhNzE5ODk1NzRjM2U5NmRiMDM2">Civil Service Jobs</a>, the official vacancy advert (post count, grades, locations, closing date and allowances); <a href="http://restless.co.uk/job/civil-service-costs-lawyersdraftspersons-seo-and-heo-roles-croydon-489298/">Rest Less</a>, which reproduces the advert text including the SEO and HEO salary bands.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How many costs lawyer posts are open?</h3><p>Five posts are open in total, split across the SEO and HEO grades.</p><h3>What is the pay?</h3><p>SEO pay is £47,850 nationally and £49,314 in Croydon and London; HEO pay is £36,553 nationally and £38,780 in Croydon and London, plus allowances.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>Applications close at noon on Monday 23 November 2026.</p><h3>Where are the roles based?</h3><p>Croydon, Leeds, London and Manchester, on a hybrid working pattern.</p>$$,
$$<p>सरकारी कानुनी विभागले GLD कस्ट्स वकिल जागिरका लागि आफ्नो कस्ट्स टोलीमा वरिष्ठ कार्यकारी अधिकारी र उच्च कार्यकारी अधिकारी ग्रेडमा ५ कस्ट्स वकिल तथा ड्राफ्ट्सपर्सन पदका लागि आवेदन खुलाएको छ। आवेदन सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ दिउँसो १२ बजे बन्द हुन्छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>सरकारी कानुनी विभाग, मुद्दा निर्देशनालय, कस्ट्स टोली</td></tr><tr><td>कुल पद</td><td>५ कस्ट्स वकिल तथा ड्राफ्ट्सपर्सन पद, SEO र HEO ग्रेड</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>SEO £47,850 राष्ट्रिय, £49,314 क्रोइडन र लन्डन; HEO £36,553 राष्ट्रिय, £38,780 क्रोइडन र लन्डन; योग्य कस्ट्स वकिलका लागि वार्षिक £6,174 सम्म भत्ता</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ दिउँसो १२ बजे बन्द</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>सिभिल सर्भिस जब्सबाट अनलाइन, सन्दर्भ ४८९२९८</td></tr><tr><td>योग्यता</td><td>ग्रेडअनुसार कस्ट्स वकिल योग्यता वा कस्ट्स कार्यको अनुभव</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>कस्ट्स टोली सरकारी कानुनी विभागको मुद्दा निर्देशनालयमा छ, जसले धेरैजसो बेलायती सरकारी विभागलाई मुद्दा सेवा दिन्छ। टोली कानुनी लागत कार्यका लागि तोकिएको उत्कृष्टता केन्द्र हो। पदाधिकारीले लागत मामिलाहरूको कार्यभार सम्हाल्छन् र कनिष्ठ टोली सदस्यको रेखदेख गर्ने सम्भावना हुन्छ। भूमिका क्रोइडन, लिड्स, लन्डन र म्यानचेस्टरमा हाइब्रिड ढाँचामा छन्।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>SEO पद भर्खरै योग्य भएका कस्ट्स वकिल वा प्रमाणित प्राविधिक सीप भएका अनुभवी ड्राफ्ट्सपर्सनका लागि उपयुक्त छ। HEO पद कस्ट्स कार्यमा केही अनुभव भएकाका लागि उपयुक्त छ। दुवै ग्रेडलाई लागत मामिला व्यवस्थापन गर्ने निर्णय क्षमता चाहिन्छ।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>SEO तलब राष्ट्रिय रूपमा वार्षिक £47,850 र क्रोइडन तथा लन्डनमा £49,314 छ। HEO तलब राष्ट्रिय रूपमा £36,553 र क्रोइडन तथा लन्डनमा £38,780 छ। टोलीले भर्ती तथा प्रतिधारण योजना पनि चलाउँछ: सन्तोषजनक कार्यसम्पादन गर्ने कर्मचारीलाई वार्षिक £1,500 र CLPQ अध्ययनमा प्रतिबद्ध हुनेलाई थप £1,544 दिइन्छ, र योग्य कस्ट्स वकिलले सबै भत्ता समावेश गरी वार्षिक £6,174 पाउँछन्।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ दिउँसो १२ बजेअघि सिभिल सर्भिस जब्सबाट अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्, सन्दर्भ ४८९२९८ खोजेर। फारमका योग्यता खण्डमा गल्ती भएमा रिक्ति बन्द हुनुभन्दा दुई कार्य दिनभन्दा बढी अघि सम्पर्क गरेमा मात्र सच्याउन सकिन्छ।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>विज्ञापनले ५ पद SEO र HEO ग्रेड वा चार स्थानबीच कसरी बाँडिएका छन् भन्ने बताएको छैन। अन्तर्वार्ता मिति, सुरु मिति वा भिसा प्रायोजन उपलब्ध छ कि छैन भन्ने पनि बताएको छैन।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> सिभिल सर्भिस जब्समा आवेदन निःशुल्क छ, र सरकारी कानुनी विभागले आवेदन, अन्तर्वार्ता वा जागिर प्रस्तावका लागि कहिल्यै पैसा माग्दैन।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/index.cgi?SID=c2VhcmNoc29ydD1zY29yZSZ1c2Vyc2VhcmNoY29udGV4dD0yMTk1MDgzNjYmc2VhcmNocGFnZT0xJm93bmVyPTUwNzAwMDAmam9ibGlzdF92aWV3X3ZhYz0yMDIwNTYxJnBhZ2VjbGFzcz1Kb2JzJnBhZ2VhY3Rpb249dmlld3ZhY2J5am9ibGlzdCZvd25lcnR5cGU9ZmFpciZyZXFzaWc9MTc5NDIyMTU5My04N2M3NzQ1ZjU5Y2QzYWE1NTljMjhhNzE5ODk1NzRjM2U5NmRiMDM2">सिभिल सर्भिस जब्स</a>, आधिकारिक रिक्ति विज्ञापन; <a href="http://restless.co.uk/job/civil-service-costs-lawyersdraftspersons-seo-and-heo-roles-croydon-489298/">Rest Less</a>, विज्ञापन पाठको पुनरुत्पादन।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>कति कस्ट्स वकिल पद खुलेका छन्?</h3><p>कुल ५ पद खुलेका छन्, SEO र HEO ग्रेडमा बाँडिएका।</p><h3>तलब कति छ?</h3><p>SEO तलब राष्ट्रिय रूपमा £47,850 र क्रोइडन तथा लन्डनमा £49,314 छ; HEO तलब राष्ट्रिय रूपमा £36,553 र क्रोइडन तथा लन्डनमा £38,780 छ, साथै भत्ता।</p><h3>आवेदन कहिले बन्द हुन्छ?</h3><p>आवेदन सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ दिउँसो १२ बजे बन्द हुन्छ।</p>$$,
