'CMA programme support officer jobs in the Digital Markets Unit pay £32,330 to £34,658. Applications close 23 November 2026.',
'CMA कार्यक्रम सहयोग अधिकारी जागिर: डिजिटल बजार एकाइमा तलब £32,330 देखि £34,658, स्थायी करारमा। आवेदन २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा बन्द हुन्छ।',
$$<p>The Competition and Markets Authority is hiring for CMA programme support officer jobs in its Digital Markets Unit, at Executive Officer grade on a permanent contract. Applications close at 23:55 on Monday 23 November 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Competition and Markets Authority, Digital Markets Unit</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>£32,330 to £34,658 a year, Executive Officer grade, permanent</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Closing 23:55, Monday 23 November 2026; sift 24 November to 4 December 2026; interviews week commencing 14 December 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through Civil Service Jobs, reference 489389</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>CV, personal statement and online application form</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Success Profiles: Behaviours and Experience, then interview with presentation</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the programme support officer job involves</h2><p>The Digital Markets Unit was set up to promote greater competition and innovation in digital markets, for the benefit of consumers, under the new digital markets competition regime. A Programme Support Officer joins a multidisciplinary team working on a strategic market status investigation, known as an SMS investigation, or on other preparatory investigation work, and also provides wider administrative support to other teams in the unit. The work is varied: keeping investigations on track, supporting governance, and helping expert teams deliver. The post is permanent and full time, based in Belfast, Cardiff, Edinburgh, London or Manchester. Readers following other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/uk">UK jobs</a> can also read our report on the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/hmrc-tax-specialist-programme-500-posts-20261025">HMRC Tax Specialist Programme</a>, another UK government recruitment closing soon.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>The advert welcomes people from a wide range of backgrounds, including digital markets, data and technology, research, policy, regulation, project management, legal work and economics. Applicants submit a CV, a personal statement and an online application form, and are assessed under the Success Profiles framework on behaviours and experience. The interview includes a presentation. The advert does not set a degree requirement, so the strength of an application rests on relevant experience and clear examples.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>Pay is £32,330 to £34,658 a year at Executive Officer grade. The package includes 25 days of annual leave, rising to 30 days over five years, plus 8 public holidays and an additional day off for the Kings birthday, and a Civil Service pension with a 28.97 percent employer contribution. Season ticket loans, a cycle to work scheme, flu vaccinations, eye tests and wellbeing benefits are also listed.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply online through Civil Service Jobs, searching for reference 489389, before 23:55 on Monday 23 November 2026. Late applications are not accepted. The sift runs from 24 November to 4 December 2026, and interviews are held from the week commencing 14 December 2026 via Microsoft Teams. Questions about the recruitment go to recruitment@cma.gov.uk.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The advert does not state how many Programme Support Officer posts are open, and it does not say which of the five locations each post sits in. It does not state whether visa sponsorship is available, and the interview dates are indicative and may change.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> Civil Service Jobs applications are free, and the Competition and Markets Authority will never ask for money in exchange for an application, an interview or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/index.cgi?SID=c2VhcmNoc29ydD1nZW9kaXN0YW5jZSZzZWFyY2hwYWdlPTImb3duZXJ0eXBlPWZhaXImam9ibGlzdF92aWV3X3ZhYz0yMDIwNjA1Jm93bmVyPTUwNzAwMDAmdXNlcnNlYXJjaGNvbnRleHQ9MjIwNzEwMDg0JnBhZ2VhY3Rpb249dmlld3ZhY2J5am9ibGlzdCZwYWdlY2xhc3M9Sm9icyZyZXFzaWc9MTc5NDc3NjQyMS1lMzcyZW">Civil Service Jobs</a>, the official vacancy advert (pay, closing date, sift and interview timeline); <a href="http://restless.co.uk/job/civil-service-programme-support-officer-belfast-489389/">Rest Less</a>, which reproduces the advert text including the salary band and reference number.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What grade is the post?</h3><p>Executive Officer, on a permanent contract in the Digital Markets Unit.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>Applications close at 23:55 on Monday 23 November 2026, and late applications are not accepted.</p><h3>Where is the role based?</h3><p>Belfast, Cardiff, Edinburgh, London or Manchester.</p><h3>What does the Digital Markets Unit do?</h3><p>It promotes greater competition and innovation in digital markets under the new digital markets competition regime.</p>$$,
$$<p>प्रतिस्पर्धा तथा बजार प्राधिकरणले आफ्नो डिजिटल बजार एकाइमा कार्यकारी अधिकारी ग्रेडमा स्थायी करारमा CMA कार्यक्रम सहयोग अधिकारी जागिरका लागि आवेदन खुलाएको छ। आवेदन सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ राति ११:५५ बजे बन्द हुन्छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>प्रतिस्पर्धा तथा बजार प्राधिकरण, डिजिटल बजार एकाइ</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>वार्षिक £32,330 देखि £34,658, कार्यकारी अधिकारी ग्रेड, स्थायी</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ राति ११:५५ बजे बन्द; छनोट २४ नोभेम्बरदेखि ४ डिसेम्बर; अन्तर्वार्ता १४ डिसेम्बरबाट सुरु हुने हप्ता</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>सिभिल सर्भिस जब्सबाट अनलाइन, सन्दर्भ ४८९३८९</td></tr><tr><td>योग्यता</td><td>CV, व्यक्तिगत विवरण र अनलाइन आवेदन फारम</td></tr><tr><td>छनोट</td><td>सक्सेस प्रोफाइल: व्यवहार र अनुभव, त्यसपछि प्रस्तुतीकरणसहित अन्तर्वार्ता</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>डिजिटल बजार एकाइ नयाँ डिजिटल बजार प्रतिस्पर्धा व्यवस्थाअन्तर्गत उपभोक्ताको हितका लागि डिजिटल बजारमा बढी प्रतिस्पर्धा र नवीनता प्रवर्द्धन गर्न स्थापना गरिएको हो। कार्यक्रम सहयोग अधिकारी रणनीतिक बजार स्थिति अनुसन्धान वा अन्य तयारी अनुसन्धान कार्यमा बहुविषयक टोलीमा सामेल हुन्छन् र एकाइका अन्य टोलीलाई व्यापक प्रशासनिक सहयोग पनि दिन्छन्। यो पद स्थायी र पूर्णकालीन हो, बेलफास्ट, कार्डिफ, एडिनबर्ग, लन्डन वा म्यानचेस्टरमा।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>विज्ञापनले डिजिटल बजार, डाटा तथा प्रविधि, अनुसन्धान, नीति, नियमन, परियोजना व्यवस्थापन, कानुनी कार्य र अर्थशास्त्रसहित विभिन्न पृष्ठभूमिका व्यक्तिलाई स्वागत गर्छ। आवेदकले CV, व्यक्तिगत विवरण र अनलाइन आवेदन फारम पेस गर्छन्, र सक्सेस प्रोफाइल ढाँचाअन्तर्गत व्यवहार र अनुभवका आधारमा मूल्याङ्कन गरिन्छ। अन्तर्वार्तामा प्रस्तुतीकरण समावेश हुन्छ।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>कार्यकारी अधिकारी ग्रेडमा तलब वार्षिक £32,330 देखि £34,658 छ। सुविधामा पाँच वर्षमा ३० दिनसम्म बढ्ने २५ दिन वार्षिक बिदा, ८ सार्वजनिक बिदा र राजाको जन्मदिनमा थप एक दिन बिदा, र २८.९७ प्रतिशत रोजगारदाता योगदानसहितको सिभिल सर्भिस पेन्सन समावेश छ।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ राति ११:५५ बजेअघि सिभिल सर्भिस जब्सबाट अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्, सन्दर्भ ४८९३८९ खोजेर। ढिलो आवेदन स्वीकार गरिँदैन। छनोट २४ नोभेम्बरदेखि ४ डिसेम्बरसम्म हुन्छ र अन्तर्वार्ता १४ डिसेम्बरबाट सुरु हुने हप्तादेखि Microsoft Teams मार्फत हुन्छ।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>विज्ञापनले कति कार्यक्रम सहयोग अधिकारी पद खुलेका छन् भन्ने बताएको छैन, र कुन पद कुन स्थानमा छ भन्ने पनि बताएको छैन। भिसा प्रायोजन उपलब्ध छ कि छैन भन्ने पनि बताएको छैन।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> सिभिल सर्भिस जब्समा आवेदन निःशुल्क छ, र प्रतिस्पर्धा तथा बजार प्राधिकरणले आवेदन, अन्तर्वार्ता वा जागिर प्रस्तावका लागि कहिल्यै पैसा माग्दैन।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/index.cgi?SID=c2VhcmNoc29ydD1nZW9kaXN0YW5jZSZzZWFyY2hwYWdlPTImb3duZXJ0eXBlPWZhaXImam9ibGlzdF92aWV3X3ZhYz0yMDIwNjA1Jm93bmVyPTUwNzAwMDAmdXNlcnNlYXJjaGNvbnRleHQ9MjIwNzEwMDg0JnBhZ2VhY3Rpb249dmlld3ZhY2J5am9ibGlzdCZwYWdlY2xhc3M9Sm9icyZyZXFzaWc9MTc5NDc3NjQyMS1lMzcyZW">सिभिल सर्भिस जब्स</a>, आधिकारिक रिक्ति विज्ञापन; <a href="http://restless.co.uk/job/civil-service-programme-support-officer-belfast-489389/">Rest Less</a>, विज्ञापन पाठको पुनरुत्पादन।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>पद कुन ग्रेडको हो?</h3><p>कार्यकारी अधिकारी, डिजिटल बजार एकाइमा स्थायी करारमा।</p><h3>आवेदन कहिले बन्द हुन्छ?</h3><p>आवेदन सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ राति ११:५५ बजे बन्द हुन्छ, र ढिलो आवेदन स्वीकार गरिँदैन।</p><h3>भूमिका कहाँ छ?</h3><p>बेलफास्ट, कार्डिफ, एडिनबर्ग, लन्डन वा म्यानचेस्टर।</p>$$,
