'GOSH स्टाफ नर्स जागिर: लन्डनको ग्रेट ओर्मन्ड स्ट्रिट अस्पतालमा ब्यान्ड ५ SNAPS पदको तलब £38,488 देखि £46,852। आवेदन २५ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा बन्द हुन्छ।',
$$<p>Great Ormond Street Hospital for Children is hiring for GOSH staff nurse jobs, with a Band 5 Staff Nurse post in General Surgery, in the Specialist Neonatal and Paediatric Surgery area known as SNAPS. Applications close at 23:59 on Tuesday 25 November 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Great Ormond Street Hospital for Children NHS Foundation Trust</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>Staff Nurse, General Surgery (SNAPS), Band 5, reference 271-BBM-8272964-A</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>£38,488 to £46,852 pro rata per annum inclusive</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Closing 23:59, Tuesday 25 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through NHS Jobs</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>Registered nurse with current UK NMC registration</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the GOSH staff nurse job involves</h2><p>The SNAPS area, covered by the Chameleon and Squirrel wards, cares for children having Specialist Neonatal and Paediatric Surgery. The Staff Nurse works as part of the ward team caring for individual children and supervising other staff in that activity, in one of the best known childrens hospitals in the UK. The post is permanent and available full time or part time, at 37.5 hours a week for a full time pattern. The ward manager for informal enquiries is Sarah Whincup. Readers following other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/uk">UK jobs</a> can also read our roundup of <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/uk-nhs-jobs-visa-sponsorship-november-2026-20261121">NHS jobs with visa sponsorship</a>, which lists other NHS roles closing from 22 November onwards.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>The post is for NMC-registered nurses. The listing seeks nurses who are enthusiastic, compassionate and highly motivated, with experience of caring for children and of supervising other staff. The advert does not set a minimum number of years of post-registration experience in the summary, so applicants should show relevant paediatric or surgical experience in their application and check the full job description and person specification on NHS Jobs before applying.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>Pay is £38,488 to £46,852 pro rata per annum inclusive, on the NHS Band 5 scale. The figure is inclusive, which in a London trust normally means it includes the London weighting element, but the listing does not break the total down, so the exact split is not stated.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply online through NHS Jobs, searching for the Great Ormond Street Hospital Staff Nurse post in General Surgery (SNAPS), reference 271-BBM-8272964-A, before 23:59 on Tuesday 25 November 2026. The listing notes that the closing date is a guide only, and the vacancy may close early once enough applications have been received, so applying early is safer than waiting for the deadline.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The listing does not state how many Staff Nurse posts are open in SNAPS, and it does not give an interview date or a start date. It does not state whether Skilled Worker visa sponsorship is available for this particular post, so international applicants should check the sponsorship wording on the NHS Jobs advert itself rather than assuming it. The listing also does not state the exact split of the pay figure.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> NHS Jobs applications are free, and Great Ormond Street Hospital will never ask for money in exchange for an application, an interview or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.healthjobsuk.com/job/UK/London/London/Great_Ormond_Street_Hospital_Children_NHS_Foundation_Trust/General_Surgery_SNAPS/General_Surgery_SNAPS-v8431755">HealthJobsUK (NHS Trac)</a>, the official NHS recruitment listing (post, band, pay, closing date and reference); <a href="https://www.jobs.nhs.uk/">NHS Jobs</a>, the official NHS application portal.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What is SNAPS?</h3><p>SNAPS is Specialist Neonatal and Paediatric Surgery at Great Ormond Street Hospital, covered by the Chameleon and Squirrel wards.</p><h3>What is the pay?</h3><p>Band 5 pay of £38,488 to £46,852 pro rata per annum inclusive.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>Applications close at 23:59 on Tuesday 25 November 2026, but the vacancy may close early if enough applications arrive.</p><h3>Is the post full time?</h3><p>The post is permanent and available full time or part time, at 37.5 hours a week for a full time pattern.</p>$$,
$$<p>ग्रेट ओर्मन्ड स्ट्रिट अस्पताल फर चिल्ड्रेनले GOSH स्टाफ नर्स जागिरका लागि सामान्य शल्यक्रियामा ब्यान्ड ५ स्टाफ नर्स पदका लागि आवेदन खुलाएको छ, विशेष नवजात तथा बाल शल्यक्रिया क्षेत्रमा जसलाई SNAPS भनिन्छ। आवेदन मंगलबार २५ नोभेम्बर २०२६ राति ११:५९ बजे बन्द हुन्छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>ग्रेट ओर्मन्ड स्ट्रिट अस्पताल फर चिल्ड्रेन NHS फाउन्डेसन ट्रस्ट</td></tr><tr><td>पद</td><td>स्टाफ नर्स, सामान्य शल्यक्रिया (SNAPS), ब्यान्ड ५, सन्दर्भ २७१-BBM-८२७२९६४-A</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>वार्षिक £38,488 देखि £46,852, समानुपातिक, समावेशी</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>मंगलबार २५ नोभेम्बर २०२६ राति ११:५९ बजे बन्द</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>NHS जब्सबाट अनलाइन</td></tr><tr><td>योग्यता</td><td>हालको बेलायती NMC दर्तासहित दर्तावाल नर्स</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>SNAPS क्षेत्र, क्यामेलियन र स्क्विरल वार्डले समेट्ने, विशेष नवजात तथा बाल शल्यक्रिया गराउने बच्चाहरूको हेरचाह गर्छ। स्टाफ नर्सले वार्ड टोलीको भागका रूपमा व्यक्तिगत बच्चाहरूको हेरचाह गर्छन् र अन्य कर्मचारीको पर्यवेक्षण गर्छन्। यो पद स्थायी हो र पूर्णकालीन वा अंशकालीन उपलब्ध छ, पूर्णकालीन ढाँचामा हप्तामा ३७.५ घण्टा।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>यो पद NMC मा दर्ता भएका नर्सहरूका लागि हो। सूचीले उत्साही, दयालु र अत्यधिक उत्प्रेरित नर्सहरू खोज्छ, जससँग बच्चाहरूको हेरचाह र अन्य कर्मचारीको पर्यवेक्षणको अनुभव छ।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>NHS ब्यान्ड ५ मा तलब वार्षिक £38,488 देखि £46,852 समानुपातिक समावेशी छ।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>NHS जब्सबाट अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्, ग्रेट ओर्मन्ड स्ट्रिट अस्पतालको सामान्य शल्यक्रिया (SNAPS) स्टाफ नर्स पद खोजेर, सन्दर्भ २७१-BBM-८२७२९६४-A, मंगलबार २५ नोभेम्बर २०२६ राति ११:५९ बजेअघि। सूचीले अन्तिम मिति मार्गदर्शन मात्र हो र पर्याप्त आवेदन आएपछि रिक्ति चाँडै बन्द हुन सक्छ भन्ने उल्लेख गर्छ।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>सूचीले SNAPS मा कति स्टाफ नर्स पद खुलेका छन् भन्ने बताएको छैन, र अन्तर्वार्ता मिति वा सुरु मिति पनि दिएको छैन। यो विशेष पदका लागि दक्ष कामदार भिसा प्रायोजन उपलब्ध छ कि छैन भन्ने पनि बताएको छैन, त्यसैले अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय आवेदकले NHS जब्स विज्ञापनमा प्रायोजन शब्द आफैँ जाँच्नुपर्छ।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> NHS जब्समा आवेदन निःशुल्क छ, र ग्रेट ओर्मन्ड स्ट्रिट अस्पतालले आवेदन, अन्तर्वार्ता वा जागिर प्रस्तावका लागि कहिल्यै पैसा माग्दैन।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.healthjobsuk.com/job/UK/London/London/Great_Ormond_Street_Hospital_Children_NHS_Foundation_Trust/General_Surgery_SNAPS/General_Surgery_SNAPS-v8431755">HealthJobsUK (NHS Trac)</a>, आधिकारिक NHS भर्ती सूची; <a href="https://www.jobs.nhs.uk/">NHS जब्स</a>, आधिकारिक NHS आवेदन पोर्टल।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>SNAPS भनेको के हो?</h3><p>SNAPS ग्रेट ओर्मन्ड स्ट्रिट अस्पतालमा विशेष नवजात तथा बाल शल्यक्रिया हो, क्यामेलियन र स्क्विरल वार्डले समेट्ने।</p><h3>तलब कति छ?</h3><p>ब्यान्ड ५ तलब वार्षिक £38,488 देखि £46,852 समानुपातिक समावेशी छ।</p><h3>आवेदन कहिले बन्द हुन्छ?</h3><p>आवेदन मंगलबार २५ नोभेम्बर २०२६ राति ११:५९ बजे बन्द हुन्छ, तर पर्याप्त आवेदन आएमा रिक्ति चाँडै बन्द हुन सक्छ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.healthjobsuk.com/job/UK/London/London/Great_Ormond_Street_Hospital_Children_NHS_Foundation_Trust/General_Surgery_SNAPS/General_Surgery_SNAPS-v8431755', 'https://www.jobs.nhs.uk/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-20'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- public-safety-dispatcher-jobs-nps-20261122 (usa; English 736 words; Nepali 441 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-20'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'public-safety-dispatcher-jobs-nps-20261122', 'usa', 'USA',
'Public Safety Dispatcher Jobs: 13 National Park Service Posts',
'जन सुरक्षा डिस्प्याचर जागिर: राष्ट्रिय निकुञ्ज सेवामा १३ पद',
'Public safety dispatcher jobs: 13 National Park Service posts across five parks, GS-05 to GS-08. Apply by 31 December 2026.',
'जन सुरक्षा डिस्प्याचर जागिर: पाँच निकुञ्जमा राष्ट्रिय निकुञ्ज सेवाका १३ पद, GS-05 देखि GS-08। ३१ डिसेम्बर २०२६ सम्म आवेदन दिनुहोस्।',
$$<p>The National Park Service is hiring for public safety dispatcher jobs, with 13 Public Safety Dispatcher posts open across five parks and sites in the United States. The announcement is open continuously until 31 December 2026, with applications referred every 15 days.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>National Park Service, US Department of the Interior</td></tr><tr><td>Total posts</td><td>13 across five locations: Everglades NP 1, Great Smoky Mountains NP 1, Lake Mead NRA 6, Mount Rushmore NM 1, National Capital Region Communications Center 4</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>GS-05 to GS-08 grades; the announcement does not state a dollar salary figure</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Open continuously until 31 December 2026; referral cut-off dates every 15 days</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through USAJobs</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>One year of specialised experience at the next lower grade, or a bachelors degree for GS-05</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Category rating; resume of no more than 2 pages</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the public safety dispatcher job involves</h2><p>Public Safety Dispatchers coordinate the first emergency response in national parks, taking emergency calls, judging what help is needed, and sending law enforcement, fire, medical and search and rescue teams under interagency guides and protocols. They use specialist systems including NCIC, NLETS and computer aided dispatch, and at the full performance GS-08 level they act as senior dispatcher, training newer staff and improving procedures. Some posts are permanent full time and some may be filled as permanent career seasonal, with at least 26 weeks of full time work a year. The roles are eligible for the EXPLORE Act Veteran Hiring Pilot, which connects veterans with Department of the Interior jobs. Readers following other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/usa">USA jobs</a> can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/fbi-intelligence-analyst-special-agent-jobs-20261121">FBI intelligence analyst and special agent jobs</a>, another US federal hiring round.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>The announcement is open to US citizens or nationals, and to career transition eligibles. For GS-05, applicants need one year of specialised experience at GS-04 level, or a bachelors degree, or a combination of the two. For GS-06, GS-07 and GS-08, applicants need one year at the next lower grade, and education cannot be substituted for experience at those grades. Relevant experience includes work as a security guard, law enforcement officer or emergency responder, and dispatch work using multi-line telephones or radio systems. Applicants must pass a background investigation and a drug test, and be ready for on-call, evening, weekend, holiday and overtime shift work. A one year probationary period applies.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>Pay is set by GS grade, from GS-05 to GS-08 depending on the location and the applicants qualifications. The announcement text I read does not state a dollar salary figure, so the exact pay depends on the grade offered and the locality of the duty station. The announcement does not state allowances either, so applicants should check the pay line on the USAJobs posting for their chosen location before applying.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply online through USAJobs, on the National Park Service Public Safety Dispatcher announcement, before it closes on 31 December 2026. The resume must be no more than 2 pages. Because it is an open continuous announcement, applications are referred at cut-off dates every 15 days, so applying early puts a candidate in an earlier referral group rather than waiting for the closing date.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The announcement does not state a dollar salary figure for any grade or location, and it does not say how many of the 13 posts are permanent full time and how many are career seasonal. It does not give exact shift patterns for each park, and the non-pay period for seasonal posts varies by location. The announcement also does not name a single closing time on 31 December, only the date.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> USAJobs applications are free, and the National Park Service will never ask for money in exchange for an application, an assessment or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.usajobs.gov/job/887241200">USAJobs</a>, the official vacancy announcement (post count, locations, grades, closing date and qualifications); <a href="https://www.doi.gov/veterans/explore-act">US Department of the Interior</a>, on the EXPLORE Act Veteran Hiring Pilot that covers this role.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How many dispatcher posts are open?</h3><p>Thirteen posts across five locations: Everglades 1, Great Smoky Mountains 1, Lake Mead 6, Mount Rushmore 1 and the National Capital Region Communications Center 4.</p><h3>What grades are available?</h3><p>GS-05 to GS-08, depending on the location and the applicants experience.</p><h3>When does the announcement close?</h3><p>31 December 2026, with applications referred at cut-off dates every 15 days.</p><h3>Do I need a degree?</h3><p>A bachelors degree can qualify an applicant for GS-05, but GS-06 to GS-08 require a year of specialised experience at the next lower grade.</p>$$,
$$<p>राष्ट्रिय निकुञ्ज सेवाले जन सुरक्षा डिस्प्याचर जागिरका लागि संयुक्त राज्य अमेरिकाका पाँच निकुञ्ज तथा स्थलमा १३ जन सुरक्षा डिस्प्याचर पदका लागि आवेदन खुलाएको छ। यो विज्ञापन ३१ डिसेम्बर २०२६ सम्म निरन्तर खुला छ, र आवेदन प्रत्येक १५ दिनमा सिफारिस गरिन्छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>राष्ट्रिय निकुञ्ज सेवा, अमेरिकी आन्तरिक विभाग</td></tr><tr><td>कुल पद</td><td>पाँच स्थानमा १३: एभरग्लेड्स NP १, ग्रेट स्मोकी माउन्टेन्स NP १, लेक मिड NRA ६, माउन्ट रसमोर NM १, राष्ट्रिय राजधानी क्षेत्र सञ्चार केन्द्र ४</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>GS-05 देखि GS-08 ग्रेड; विज्ञापनले डलर तलब अङ्क बताएको छैन</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>३१ डिसेम्बर २०२६ सम्म निरन्तर खुला; प्रत्येक १५ दिनमा सिफारिस कट-अफ मिति</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>USAJobs बाट अनलाइन</td></tr><tr><td>योग्यता</td><td>अर्को तल्लो ग्रेडमा एक वर्षको विशेष अनुभव, वा GS-05 का लागि स्नातक डिग्री</td></tr><tr><td>छनोट</td><td>श्रेणी मूल्याङ्कन; २ पृष्ठभन्दा बढी नहुने रिजुम</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>जन सुरक्षा डिस्प्याचरहरूले राष्ट्रिय निकुञ्जमा पहिलो आपतकालीन प्रतिक्रियाको समन्वय गर्छन्, आपतकालीन कल लिन्छन्, कस्तो सहयोग चाहिन्छ भन्ने निर्णय गर्छन् र कानुन प्रवर्तन, अग्नि, चिकित्सा तथा खोज र उद्धार टोली पठाउँछन्। उनीहरूले NCIC, NLETS र कम्प्युटर सहायता प्राप्त डिस्प्याचसहित विशेष प्रणाली प्रयोग गर्छन्, र पूर्ण कार्यसम्पादन GS-08 तहमा वरिष्ठ डिस्प्याचरका रूपमा काम गर्छन्। केही पद स्थायी पूर्णकालीन र केही स्थायी करियर मौसमी हुन सक्छन्।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>विज्ञापन अमेरिकी नागरिक वा राष्ट्रियका लागि खुला छ। GS-05 का लागि GS-04 तहमा एक वर्षको विशेष अनुभव वा स्नातक डिग्री चाहिन्छ। GS-06, GS-07 र GS-08 का लागि अर्को तल्लो ग्रेडमा एक वर्ष चाहिन्छ, र ती ग्रेडमा शिक्षाले अनुभवलाई प्रतिस्थापन गर्न सक्दैन। आवेदकले पृष्ठभूमि अनुसन्धान र लागुऔषध परीक्षण पास गर्नुपर्छ र अन-कल, साँझ, सप्ताहन्त, बिदा र ओभरटाइम सिफ्ट कार्यका लागि तयार हुनुपर्छ।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>तलब GS ग्रेडअनुसार निर्धारण हुन्छ, स्थान र आवेदकको योग्यताअनुसार GS-05 देखि GS-08 सम्म। मैले पढेको विज्ञापन पाठले डलर तलब अङ्क बताएको छैन, त्यसैले ठ्याक्कै तलब प्रस्ताव गरिएको ग्रेड र कर्तव्य स्थलको स्थानमा निर्भर गर्छ।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>३१ डिसेम्बर २०२६ मा बन्द हुनुअघि USAJobs बाट अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्। रिजुम २ पृष्ठभन्दा बढी हुनु हुँदैन। यो निरन्तर खुला विज्ञापन भएकाले आवेदन प्रत्येक १५ दिनमा कट-अफ मितिमा सिफारिस गरिन्छ, त्यसैले चाँडै आवेदन दिनु राम्रो हुन्छ।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>विज्ञापनले कुनै पनि ग्रेड वा स्थानका लागि डलर तलब अङ्क बताएको छैन, र १३ पदमध्ये कति स्थायी पूर्णकालीन र कति करियर मौसमी हुन् भन्ने पनि बताएको छैन। प्रत्येक निकुञ्जका लागि ठ्याक्कै सिफ्ट ढाँचा पनि दिएको छैन।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> USAJobs मा आवेदन निःशुल्क छ, र राष्ट्रिय निकुञ्ज सेवाले आवेदन, मूल्याङ्कन वा जागिर प्रस्तावका लागि कहिल्यै पैसा माग्दैन।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.usajobs.gov/job/887241200">USAJobs</a>, आधिकारिक रिक्ति विज्ञापन; <a href="https://www.doi.gov/veterans/explore-act">अमेरिकी आन्तरिक विभाग</a>, यो भूमिका समेट्ने EXPLORE ऐन भेटेरन भर्ती पाइलटबारे।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>कति डिस्प्याचर पद खुलेका छन्?</h3><p>पाँच स्थानमा १३ पद: एभरग्लेड्स १, ग्रेट स्मोकी माउन्टेन्स १, लेक मिड ६, माउन्ट रसमोर १ र राष्ट्रिय राजधानी क्षेत्र सञ्चार केन्द्र ४।</p><h3>कुन ग्रेड उपलब्ध छन्?</h3><p>स्थान र आवेदकको अनुभवअनुसार GS-05 देखि GS-08 सम्म।</p><h3>विज्ञापन कहिले बन्द हुन्छ?</h3><p>३१ डिसेम्बर २०२६, प्रत्येक १५ दिनमा कट-अफ मितिमा आवेदन सिफारिस गरिन्छ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.usajobs.gov/job/887241200', 'https://www.doi.gov/veterans/explore-act'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-20'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- aps4-case-officer-jobs-psr-canberra-20261122 (australia; English 581 words; Nepali 329 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-20'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'aps4-case-officer-jobs-psr-canberra-20261122', 'australia', 'Australia',
'APS4 Case Officer Jobs at PSR Canberra Close 29 November',
'APS4 केस अधिकारी जागिर: क्यानबेरामा PSR',
'APS4 case officer jobs at Professional Services Review in Canberra pay $80,970 to $86,925 plus super. Close 29 November 2026.',
'APS4 केस अधिकारी जागिर: क्यानबेरामा प्रोफेसनल सर्भिसेस रिभ्युमा तलब $80,970 देखि $86,925 र सुपर। २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा बन्द हुन्छ।',
$$<p>Professional Services Review is hiring for APS4 case officer jobs, with a Case Officer post in its Case Management Unit in Canberra. Applications close at 11:59pm ADST on Sunday 29 November 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Professional Services Review, Case Management Unit</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>APS4 Case Officer, reference 06/2026, ongoing, Canberra ACT</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>APS4 $80,970 to $86,925 plus 15.4 percent superannuation</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Closing 11:59pm ADST, Sunday 29 November 2026; interviews week commencing 7 December 2026; outcomes week commencing 21 December 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through APSJobs</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>As set out in the Candidate Information Kit</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Assessment options as set out in the kit, then interview and referee checks</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the APS4 case officer job involves</h2><p>Professional Services Review is the agency established under the Health Insurance Act 1973, and the Case Officer works in its Case Management Unit, in the Administration job family. The role is ongoing and based in Canberra, and the Candidate Information Kit prepared on 9 November 2026 sets out the assessment options the agency uses to test whether applicants are suitable. The kit gives a clear timeline: applications close on 29 November, interviews fall in the week commencing 7 December, referee checks follow the interviews, and outcomes are advised in the week commencing 21 December, subject to change. Readers following other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/australia">Australia jobs</a> can also read our roundup of <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/australia-aps-jobs-november-2026-20261121">Australia APS jobs November 2026</a>, which lists other APS roles closing this month.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>Applicants must meet the criteria in the Candidate Information Kit for reference 06/2026, and should read the kit in full before applying, since it sets out the assessment process and the timeline. The kit places the role in the Administration job family, so experience in case management or administrative work is the natural fit. The kit extract I read does not spell out a single qualification, so applicants should check the essential criteria in the full kit on the PSR website.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>Pay is APS4 $80,970 to $86,925 a year, plus 15.4 percent superannuation. That is the full published range for the classification, and the kit does not state a starting point within the band.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply online through APSJobs, the official Australian Public Service jobs portal, searching for the Professional Services Review APS4 Case Officer vacancy, reference 06/2026, before 11:59pm ADST on Sunday 29 November 2026. Keep the APSJobs profile current, since assessment invitations follow the application. Interviews are scheduled for the week commencing 7 December 2026.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The kit extract does not state how many Case Officer posts are open, and it does not state the citizenship rule or a single required qualification in the text I read. It does not give a start date, and the outcomes date of the week commencing 21 December is subject to change. Applicants should read the full Candidate Information Kit before applying rather than relying on a summary.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> APSJobs applications are free, and Professional Services Review will never ask for money in exchange for an application, an assessment or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.psr.gov.au/sites/default/files/2026-11/APS4%20Case%20Officer%20-%20Candidate%20Information%20Kit.pdf">Professional Services Review</a>, the official Candidate Information Kit (classification, pay, closing date, interview and outcomes timeline); <a href="https://www.apsjobs.gov.au/">APSJobs</a>, the official Australian Public Service application portal.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What is the pay?</h3><p>APS4 $80,970 to $86,925 a year, plus 15.4 percent superannuation.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>Applications close at 11:59pm ADST on Sunday 29 November 2026.</p><h3>Where is the role based?</h3><p>Canberra, ACT, in the Case Management Unit.</p><h3>When will I hear the outcome?</h3><p>Interviews are in the week commencing 7 December 2026, and outcomes are advised in the week commencing 21 December 2026, subject to change.</p>$$,
$$<p>प्रोफेसनल सर्भिसेस रिभ्युले APS4 केस अधिकारी जागिरका लागि क्यानबेरामा आफ्नो केस व्यवस्थापन एकाइमा केस अधिकारी पदका लागि आवेदन खुलाएको छ। आवेदन आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ राति ११:५९ बजे ADST मा बन्द हुन्छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>प्रोफेसनल सर्भिसेस रिभ्यु, केस व्यवस्थापन एकाइ</td></tr><tr><td>पद</td><td>APS4 केस अधिकारी, सन्दर्भ ०६/२०२६, निरन्तर, क्यानबेरा ACT</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>APS4 $80,970 देखि $86,925 र १५.४ प्रतिशत सुपरएन्युएसन</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ राति ११:५९ बजे ADST बन्द; अन्तर्वार्ता ७ डिसेम्बरबाट सुरु हुने हप्ता; नतिजा २१ डिसेम्बरबाट सुरु हुने हप्ता</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>APSJobs बाट अनलाइन</td></tr><tr><td>योग्यता</td><td>उम्मेदवार सूचना किटमा उल्लेख भएअनुसार</td></tr><tr><td>छनोट</td><td>किटमा उल्लेख भएअनुसार मूल्याङ्कन विकल्प, त्यसपछि अन्तर्वार्ता र रेफ्री जाँच</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>प्रोफेसनल सर्भिसेस रिभ्यु स्वास्थ्य बीमा ऐन १९७३ अन्तर्गत स्थापना भएको निकाय हो, र केस अधिकारी यसको केस व्यवस्थापन एकाइमा प्रशासन जागिर परिवारमा काम गर्छन्। भूमिका निरन्तर छ र क्यानबेरामा आधारित छ। ९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा तयार गरिएको उम्मेदवार सूचना किटले एजेन्सीले प्रयोग गर्ने मूल्याङ्कन विकल्पहरू उल्लेख गर्छ।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>आवेदकले सन्दर्भ ०६/२०२६ का लागि उम्मेदवार सूचना किटमा मापदण्ड पूरा गर्नुपर्छ, र आवेदन दिनुअघि किट पूरा पढ्नुपर्छ, किनकि यसले मूल्याङ्कन प्रक्रिया र समयरेखा उल्लेख गर्छ।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>तलब APS4 $80,970 देखि $86,925 वार्षिक छ, साथै १५.४ प्रतिशत सुपरएन्युएसन।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>आधिकारिक अस्ट्रेलियाली सार्वजनिक सेवा जागिर पोर्टल APSJobs बाट अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्, प्रोफेसनल सर्भिसेस रिभ्यु APS4 केस अधिकारी रिक्ति खोजेर, सन्दर्भ ०६/२०२६, आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ राति ११:५९ बजे ADST अघि। अन्तर्वार्ता ७ डिसेम्बर २०२६ बाट सुरु हुने हप्तामा हुन्छ।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>किटको अंशले कति केस अधिकारी पद खुलेका छन् भन्ने बताएको छैन, र मैले पढेको पाठमा नागरिकता नियम वा एउटै आवश्यक योग्यता पनि बताएको छैन। सुरु मिति पनि दिएको छैन, र २१ डिसेम्बरबाट सुरु हुने हप्ताको नतिजा मिति परिवर्तन हुन सक्छ।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> APSJobs मा आवेदन निःशुल्क छ, र प्रोफेसनल सर्भिसेस रिभ्युले आवेदन, मूल्याङ्कन वा जागिर प्रस्तावका लागि कहिल्यै पैसा माग्दैन।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.psr.gov.au/sites/default/files/2026-11/APS4%20Case%20Officer%20-%20Candidate%20Information%20Kit.pdf">प्रोफेसनल सर्भिसेस रिभ्यु</a>, आधिकारिक उम्मेदवार सूचना किट; <a href="https://www.apsjobs.gov.au/">APSJobs</a>, आधिकारिक अस्ट्रेलियाली सार्वजनिक सेवा आवेदन पोर्टल।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>तलब कति छ?</h3><p>APS4 $80,970 देखि $86,925 वार्षिक, साथै १५.४ प्रतिशत सुपरएन्युएसन।</p><h3>आवेदन कहिले बन्द हुन्छ?</h3><p>आवेदन आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ राति ११:५९ बजे ADST मा बन्द हुन्छ।</p><h3>भूमिका कहाँ छ?</h3><p>क्यानबेरा, ACT, केस व्यवस्थापन एकाइमा।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.psr.gov.au/sites/default/files/2026-11/APS4%20Case%20Officer%20-%20Candidate%20Information%20Kit.pdf', 'https://www.apsjobs.gov.au/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-20'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

